WEBVTT

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.040
Do people actually hate me?

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.150
Yeah.

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:29.960
No, wait. Why?

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:37.830
I am Ainz-sama's only creation,
proudly guarding the treasure room.

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:41.020
Or at least that's how it should be.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:45.350
But lately, I've felt others
around me giving me cold looks.

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:50.860
Sometimes, I hear people talk about my face,
my style, my fashion, and my words.

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:55.690
All of them shine brighter
than anyone else's.

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:00.080
\"Woah\" they say.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.930
Even if your fashion truly shone,

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:06.130
you should fix the way
you speak. Immediately.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.080
There you go joking again.

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:11.490
Do I look like I'm joking?

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.270
So, you personally think they're cool,

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:17.310
but other people don't value them.

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:19.260
That's what you mean, right?

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:20.120
That's right!

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:21.490
That's exactly it!

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:22.520
But, you know?

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:24.980
If you want to be loved by others,

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:27.560
you have to make an
effort to be loved, too.

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:31.600
That's important when you
live in a society. For real!

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:32.960
Ainz-sama...

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:34.110
I'm sorry to tell you,

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:37.690
but if someone asked me if you're making
the effort, that would be a resounding \"no.\"

00:01:37.690 --> 00:01:39.970
No!

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:42.890
You had better get that
through your head first.

00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:44.530
Be loved by those around you.

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:46.910
What should I do to achieve that?

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:50.170
Even if he asks me...

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:52.800
It's impossible, no matter
how you look at him.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:54.680
This guy is truly pathetic!

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:57.260
I'm not one to talk when that's
how I used to be, though.

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:01.360
Well... this could all be
a misunderstanding.

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:05.850
First, let's try to experience situations
where you're loved by others.

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:07.300
That's right...

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:09.990
How about transforming
into a cute animal like a cat,

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:12.500
and interacting with others like that?

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:14.310
A... cat?!

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:15.140
Yeah.

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:17.670
If you become something fluffy like that,

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:20.310
other people might come to love you!

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:21.720
Understood!

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:24.570
I, Pandora's Actor, will
transform into a cat,

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:28.310
and properly learn what
it means to be loved!

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:30.310
That's right. Do your best!

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:31.680
By the way, Ainz-sama!

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:32.440
Yeah?

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:35.530
What's a cat?

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:39.070
\"PlePle Pleiades\"

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:45.380
\"The Android and the Cat\"
\"PlePle Pleiades\"

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:47.940
Wonderful.

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:50.690
It sure was worth trying
again so many times.

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:52.140
That's right.

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:54.350
Transforming into something
I've never seen is hard...

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:58.010
He's right. I programmed him with all
sorts of bizarre lines and knowledge,

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:00.890
but not that kind of common sense.

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:02.280
Now that you mention it,

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:04.920
I was the one who ordered you
to stay in the treasure room,

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:06.650
so I'm sorry about that.

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:10.390
That's completely right, Ainz-sama!

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:11.390
How blunt!

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:13.350
Such a quick change in attitude!

00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:14.950
Well, I also added that,

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:16.800
and it's part of my dark past as well.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.660
So I can only play along.

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:22.520
However, this thing you call
a \"cat\" sure is wonderful.

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:26.890
I like wiping the items
in the treasure room.

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:28.520
That's something I
programmed him to do!

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:31.770
But in this form, I like to take the
items and... how should I put it?

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:35.550
Roll around in them, rub myself against
them, and squeeze tightly between them!

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:37.170
Well, you're a cat, after all...

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:40.440
Is it okay with you if I turn
into this form sometimes?

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:43.260
I don't mind, so long as it doesn't
get in the way of your work.

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:45.780
Thank you so much!

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:47.960
Cats don't sound like that...

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:50.870
Meow, meow, meow... Meow!

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:53.390
What could it be? He's not cute.

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:55.600
Well then, I think it's time to get going.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:57.370
Do you have something
to do, Ainz-sama?

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:59.200
If you hide away here,

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:01.460
you will never receive the love you want.

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:03.470
Get out there and interact with others.

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:05.090
Understood!

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:11.270
CZ... what's that?

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:13.240
I got it from Ainz-sama.

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:15.690
He told me to take care
of it for the time being.

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:19.730
Why don't we fatten it up
and have it for dinner?

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:21.140
No.

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:23.190
What is this about?

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:25.260
He doesn't look strong at all.

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:27.190
He looks very weak.

00:04:27.190 --> 00:04:29.790
His face looks very unsatisfied.

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:31.310
Ladies!

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:33.510
I'm stronger than all of you.

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:35.330
Probably! Probably!

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.530
He looks like he's trying
to say something.

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:39.450
But I don't understand him at all.

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:41.570
Listen.

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:44.880
You're not allowed to let them
know you're Pandora's Actor.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:45.790
Yes!

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:47.470
Obviously you can't speak, either.

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:50.090
If you speak, you'll be
found out immediately.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:51.170
Speak in cat!

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:52.160
Something like...

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:55.190
\"Meow...\" or \"meow.\" or even \"meow!\"

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:56.800
That's pretty rough.

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:58.840
Start right now.

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:00.060
Understood!

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:02.090
I'll do as you say, My Master!

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:05.650
I hate that I can understand
him when he's meowing at me.

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:09.560
That's because it was
you who created me.

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:11.010
You like eating like this?

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:14.460
Is everybody going to love me like this?

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:19.750
However, out of all the creatures in Nazarick,

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:25.340
being treated like this by Ainz-sama
makes me feel privileged!

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:28.510
Ah, the results are already showing!

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:30.510
That being said...

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:35.230
This person's expressions are
not changing whatsoever.

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:39.820
I have to give you a name.

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:44.800
Of course, you have to
name me Pandora's Actor.

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:47.740
I'll call you Kinkan.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:49.000
Why?!

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:50.080
Are you happy?

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.740
I'm not happy at all!

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:54.810
What do you eat?

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:58.270
I think... I'll be fine, even if I don't
eat anything, mademoiselle.

00:05:58.270 --> 00:06:02.670
I'm... a doppelganger after
all... what do you think?

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:04.850
It's probably... meat, after all.

00:06:04.850 --> 00:06:06.420
I wonder...

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:08.510
What's this?

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:12.010
If you want good protein then this is it!

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:14.290
Well, I'm fine with eating them.

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:21.020
She seems mad that I'll have to eat this.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:23.780
In that case, I can just do this to reject it.

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:26.470
He's not eating at all, how spoiled.

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:29.620
Solution, do you like this?

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:32.570
I only like deceased humans,

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:34.620
but I don't particularly hate it.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:37.370
I don't hate anything.

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:39.750
Eat this.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:45.760
It doesn't make a difference to
me, but I can probably eat this.

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:50.830
So?

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:52.020
Is it good?

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:55.140
Well, I can't tell the difference
in taste, so I'll just eat it.

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:57.540
He says it's super delicious!

00:06:57.540 --> 00:06:59.480
I'm not getting through to them at all.

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:01.120
You just made that up.

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:05.530
That's good.

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:09.110
Well, I guess she's... glad?

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:18.420
What's this?

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:21.160
You've really come to like
this little guy, right, CZ?

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:25.070
I never thought that living
creatures would be this interesting.

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:29.100
I don't get what's so great
about his appearance.

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:30.840
Thank you very much!

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.510
How cute.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.290
Oh?

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:40.020
Yes? What is it?

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:44.550
There's something I'd like to
take from the treasure room.

00:07:44.550 --> 00:07:47.660
I can hear your orders, but...

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:48.900
I'm a cat at the moment.

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.650
Can't you sneak away?

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:54.760
Unfortunately, I've been caught
by CZ and remain trapped.

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:58.620
Well then... where's that
rare wrestling mask?

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:02.610
We have the Wrestling Mask
Anniversary Edition, right?

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:04.240
That's well... let's see...

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:09.280
If you walk three steps north from the place
where I always pose in the mornings...

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:13.770
And if you take your hands right there
and position them in the coolest angle,

00:08:13.770 --> 00:08:15.810
you'll see the third shelf—

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:17.310
I don't get it.

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:19.800
It would be better if I went there, then.

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:22.680
In order to do that, I'll have
to transform at least once...

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:24.550
In that case, then...

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:27.690
Maybe I should have
you wait in my room.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:30.330
Darling, please wait in my room.

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:32.960
That's right, we're just like two lovers.

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:33.900
That's wonderful.

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:35.030
Shut up!

00:08:37.730 --> 00:08:42.410
I have to go to Ainz-sama, so
I'll dash out for a little while.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:43.780
Where do you think it's going?

00:08:43.780 --> 00:08:46.170
I'm sure he's going to poop!

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:53.260
Oh? Where are you guys going?

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:56.250
Kinkan suddenly started
running, so we're chasing him.

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:58.100
It seems like he has to poop!

00:08:58.100 --> 00:08:59.680
That's completely wrong!

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:02.060
But that way is...

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:06.560
That's the trap we made for Hamsuke.

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:14.510
The trap reacts to furry living
creatures and kicks into action.

00:09:14.510 --> 00:09:18.210
After it kicks into action,
a steel ball falls on it.

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:20.560
And then it explodes.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:24.850
And then a steel cage
falls from the ceiling!

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:26.120
This is bad!

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:29.790
Everyone.

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:31.420
Lend me your strength.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.300
Move, everyone!

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:46.380
It can't be helped, then.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:51.670
I took most of its
momentum, Lupusregina.

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:53.280
Leave it to me!

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:56.900
Are you okay?

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:58.600
Did you poop yourself?

00:09:58.600 --> 00:10:01.990
I kind of feel like it when I'm in her hands.

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:06.080
While I'm holding it... Entoma, CZ!

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:09.000
We're ready over here!

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:13.750
Trap Liquidation.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.160
Did you poop already?

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:29.080
What happened to your poop?

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:31.060
As expected of the Pleiades.

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:32.620
Ainz-sama!

00:10:32.620 --> 00:10:37.630
Even I get happy when I see
you work together like that.

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:40.530
That's what I expect from my defenders.

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:42.020
It's an honor.

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:43.790
So... um...

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:45.410
What's that creature?

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:50.440
Ah, this is a small animal that
I caught in the great forest.

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:53.400
Seems like you were interested in it.

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:56.340
CZ is especially fond of him.

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:57.380
Yes.

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:58.440
I see.

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:02.300
So do you want to keep
this cat as your pet?

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:04.570
No.

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:06.470
Oh? Why's that?

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:10.180
This is the Great Tomb of Nazarick.

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:14.150
The Pleiades are supposed to serve
as shields for the Supreme Beings.

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:16.940
So as someone who
may lose her life soon,

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:20.110
I can't accept anything as my pet.

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:22.020
I see.

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:24.530
Your loyalty pleases me.

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:28.680
I think I'll let the people at Carne
Village take care of this cat.

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:30.420
Is that okay, CZ?

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:31.450
Yes.

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:37.690
You could have freed
yourself from a trap like that!

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:39.440
Well, that's right.

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:44.220
So, did you understand
what it means to be loved?

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:46.340
Of course I understood it!

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:47.750
I understand.

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:48.680
That's right!

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:51.670
There's no one who can replace me so—

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:54.870
Okay. Seems like you didn't understand
anything, so you can go back to work.

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:01.540
Welcome, lady!

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:04.950
Thanks for checking the traps as always!

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:08.960
You don't have to react like that!

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:13.290
But that's the only possible
reaction to disgusting things.

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:33.200
I was really worried!

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.980
You hadn't been back
home for several days!

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:38.670
I've been waiting for you all this time.

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:42.150
U-Um... who are you?

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:43.800
You don't know her?

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:49.550
You see... I came here to kidnap you.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:52.430
Nfirea-san, stand back!

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:56.940
We're going to have you
summon an army of undead

00:13:56.940 --> 00:14:00.440
with your talent to use any magic item.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:06.240
Won't you wear this crown of
wisdom and become our tool?

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:09.830
Do it for me.

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:21.450
\"The Dark Hero\"

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:29.760
Sorry for the wait.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:31.330
Don't worry about it.

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:33.330
The registration is done.

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:35.770
Your name is Hamsuke from now on.

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:38.270
I must thank you, Master.

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:39.330
It talked.

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:40.400
Amazing.

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:43.060
And the owner is really
only a Copper Plate?

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:44.920
He's riding such a magnificent creature.

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:47.030
He's not a famous adventurer?

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:49.080
Hey, mister.

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:53.970
Aren't you the one who went with
my grandson to collect some herbs?

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:59.080
I'm Lizzy Bareare, Nfirea's grandma.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:02.930
Yes. I acted as his bodyguard
when we went to Carne Village.

00:15:02.930 --> 00:15:04.530
My name is Momon.

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:06.890
And her name is Nabe.

00:15:06.890 --> 00:15:07.780
Also...

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:09.710
I am the Wise King of the Forest.

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:11.930
My name is Hamsuke now.

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:17.640
So this magical beast is the
legendary Wise King of the Forest?

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:19.940
That's right.

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:25.690
We encountered him with your grandson
earlier and beat it into submission.

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:26.860
Incredible!

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:29.360
So where is my grandson right now?

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:32.730
He went home with the herbs.

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:37.250
We're going to be
collecting our reward now.

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.040
I see.

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:40.830
Which means we'll be
going together, right?

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:43.330
Yes. With pleasure.

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:46.050
Who are you?!

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:51.500
The magic that summons an
Undead Army is 7th Tier magic,

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:53.650
so normal people can't use it.

00:15:53.650 --> 00:15:56.460
But it is possible with
the Crown of Wisdom.

00:15:56.460 --> 00:16:00.200
Once summoned, it's
impossible to control them all,

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:02.270
but we can give them a little nudge.

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:05.020
It's a perfect plan!

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:09.230
Nfirea-san. Run away from here, quickly!

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:10.360
B-But!

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:13.160
Ninya, you stand back as well.

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:18.040
You have to go and save your sister
who was taken away by the aristocrats!

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:19.540
Everyone...

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:24.580
Come on everyone, I'm
going to start crying.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:27.700
But I can't let you run away.

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:31.840
Stop playing around with them.

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:37.460
But you made sure their
screams won't be heard, right?

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:42.520
I can take the time to play around
with one of them, at least.

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:51.580
Momon-san!

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:58.910
Yes, Albedo-sama.

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:03.920
Everything here is going
according to Ainz-sama's plan.

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:09.500
As I pretended to be a stupid and selfish rich
woman and paraded myself around town,

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:14.180
I came into contact with a man who
seems to be a part of a criminal gang.

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:19.850
They appear to be planning
to ambush us on the road.

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:24.360
So it seems like everything
is going as planned tonight,

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:27.260
and we'll be able to capture
a large number of people.

00:17:27.260 --> 00:17:28.610
It's so simple.

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:35.940
However, it'll only work if there aren't
any magic or weapons users among them.

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:38.730
Ainz-sama, who is stationed in E-Rantel,

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:44.850
raised his Adventurer Rank by taming a
beast known as the Wise King of the Forest.

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:49.500
As expected of Ainz-sama, he's
already accomplishing great feats.

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:07.980
Shalltear-sama.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:11.230
There's something I've been
meaning to ask you for a while now.

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:13.000
What is it?

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:16.670
You don't seem to get along
very well with Aura-sama.

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:19.800
Is there any particular reason for that?

00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:22.720
I don't think we have a
bad relationship as such.

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:25.660
It's just that my creator Peroroncino-sama

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:29.380
decided that I had to tease her.

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:33.690
Peroroncino-sama and that brat's creator,

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:36.630
Bukubukuchagama-sama, are siblings.

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:38.890
Is that so?

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:43.960
I heard the Supreme Beings
talking about it once.

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:48.270
What's wrong, Peroroncino-san?

00:18:48.900 --> 00:18:52.900
I heard my sister's voice in
the eroge I bought earlier.

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:58.530
Ah, Bukubukuchagama-sama is a
pretty popular voice actress, right?

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:01.490
And I was pretty excited for it, too...

00:19:01.880 --> 00:19:04.490
You can't use a game with
your sister in it, right?

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:10.930
I've heard a voice actress's work consists of
granting a soul to things with your voice.

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:15.250
So basically, it's a job that grants life.

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:20.630
Thank you very much for letting
me know, Shalltear-sama.

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:26.020
It is a great honor for me to know
more about the Supreme Beings.

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:28.810
By the way,

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:32.770
how are you going to capture these
humans for our current mission?

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:37.500
Ainz-sama told me that he didn't care if I
sucked them dry or used them as slaves,

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:40.200
but to make sure that I captured them.

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:43.170
In that case,

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:48.850
perhaps the most suited for today's
mission would have been Demiurge.

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:51.920
His skill, Command Mantra,

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:56.810
allows the user to control the opponent's
actions, much like Aura-sama's skills.

00:19:58.850 --> 00:20:02.900
Sebas. Could you say that again?

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:10.980
Or perhaps a Dragonoid like
yourself feels like challenging me?!

00:20:11.820 --> 00:20:12.980
Of course not.

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:22.110
However, I was worried that you would have
to activate your Blood Frenzy class penalty...

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:28.370
I'll suppress Blood Frenzy.

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:29.860
Now that you mention it,

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:34.220
I'll properly fulfill this mission bestowed
by Ainz-sama, and he'll compliment me...

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:40.760
\"Well done, Shalltear. You're
my most valuable slave.\"

00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:43.690
That was my mistake.

00:20:43.690 --> 00:20:48.870
I never would have meant any insult towards
Ainz-sama, who chose you for this mission.

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:50.140
Please forgive me.

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:54.610
Seems like the carriage has stopped.

00:20:54.610 --> 00:20:56.290
It seems like it.

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:03.590
Nfirea! Momon-san's here!

00:21:03.590 --> 00:21:06.010
What happened?

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:07.330
Something troublesome.

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:13.160
Wh-What is it?

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:18.790
What's this way?

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:21.700
That's the storage room for herbs.

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:31.930
What's going on?!

00:21:40.760 --> 00:21:41.570
Zombies!

00:21:54.490 --> 00:21:56.090
Where's Nfirea?

00:21:56.090 --> 00:21:57.460
He's not here.

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:59.440
Nfirea!

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:00.510
Protect her.

00:22:00.510 --> 00:22:01.800
Understood.

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:06.820
Ninya...

00:22:10.730 --> 00:22:13.110
There are no traps...

00:22:13.110 --> 00:22:14.270
However...

00:22:14.940 --> 00:22:18.580
\"I've heard that girls can
cause a lot of trouble.\"

00:22:18.580 --> 00:22:20.060
So that's how it was.

00:22:23.760 --> 00:22:25.370
This is a little...

00:22:26.230 --> 00:22:27.860
...unpleasant.

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:30.870
A piercing weapon.

00:22:32.370 --> 00:22:35.370
My grandson, Nfirea, is not here!

00:22:36.180 --> 00:22:39.380
They didn't take anything with them,

00:22:39.380 --> 00:22:41.990
so I'm guessing they wanted Nfirea.

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:45.720
Then who are these people?

00:22:45.720 --> 00:22:49.730
They're the adventurers who went
with me and your grandson for herbs.

00:22:49.730 --> 00:22:51.430
So they're your friends?

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:52.540
No.

00:22:52.540 --> 00:22:55.270
They're just some people
who tagged along with us.

00:22:56.890 --> 00:22:58.750
More importantly, what do you think?

00:22:58.750 --> 00:22:59.520
About what?

00:22:59.970 --> 00:23:01.910
Create Undead...

00:23:01.910 --> 00:23:05.500
If they had even a 3rd Tier magic user,

00:23:05.500 --> 00:23:10.960
they could have hidden the
bodies and bought some time...

00:23:10.960 --> 00:23:14.160
Yet, they decided to leave the
bodies in this distasteful state.

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:17.230
Perhaps they didn't care
about being found out,

00:23:17.230 --> 00:23:20.720
or they were confident
that they would get away.

00:23:21.560 --> 00:23:25.330
In any case, things will get worse
if we don't do anything about it.

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:28.170
How about you make a request?

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:31.550
This is the perfect situation to hire adventurers.

00:23:32.060 --> 00:23:35.120
You sure are lucky, Lizzy Bareare.

00:23:35.120 --> 00:23:40.020
The one in front of you is the
strongest adventurer in this town,

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:43.850
and the only one who can
bring your grandson back.

00:23:43.850 --> 00:23:47.440
If you make a request,
I could take up your offer.

00:23:47.920 --> 00:23:50.210
That's right, maybe you'd be able to...

00:23:50.210 --> 00:23:51.360
I'll hire you.

00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:53.260
I have to hire you!

00:23:53.260 --> 00:23:54.480
I see.

00:23:54.480 --> 00:23:56.330
But it'll be expensive.

00:23:56.330 --> 00:23:58.290
Are you ready to pay the price?

00:23:58.290 --> 00:24:00.500
How much will satisfy you?

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:01.920
Everything!

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:02.920
What?

00:24:03.260 --> 00:24:05.630
Give me everything you have.

00:24:08.090 --> 00:24:11.480
Alright then, now we're going to
narrow down where Nfirea is.

00:24:11.480 --> 00:24:14.180
It'll be easy this time.

00:24:14.180 --> 00:24:17.060
All their plates are gone.

00:24:17.060 --> 00:24:19.090
They didn't take any valuables.

00:24:19.090 --> 00:24:20.950
Just these plates.

00:24:21.910 --> 00:24:25.850
They probably took the plates as trophies.

00:24:26.710 --> 00:24:29.940
I'm sure they've done this before,

00:24:30.940 --> 00:24:33.150
but this time, it'll cost them their lives.

00:24:35.880 --> 00:24:37.640
That's a Locate Object scroll.

00:24:37.640 --> 00:24:39.860
I'm sure you know
what we're looking for.

00:24:39.860 --> 00:24:41.160
Understood.

00:24:41.710 --> 00:24:46.750
Also, there's a possibility that our
opponents are using Detect Locate,

00:24:46.750 --> 00:24:50.270
so protecting your identity with
Fake Cover and Counter Detect

00:24:50.270 --> 00:24:52.630
is the simplest countermeasure.

00:24:55.060 --> 00:24:57.420
I think this will be enough
for our enemies this time.

00:24:58.150 --> 00:25:00.870
Alright, Narberal. Activate it.

00:25:02.110 --> 00:25:03.770
Fake Cover!

00:25:06.650 --> 00:25:08.160
Counter Detect!

00:25:09.280 --> 00:25:11.030
When using magic to gather information,

00:25:11.670 --> 00:25:14.030
it's necessary to take
protective measures.

00:25:15.000 --> 00:25:17.150
If you're going to kill another player,

00:25:17.150 --> 00:25:19.340
you have to gather information
about your enemy,

00:25:19.340 --> 00:25:20.900
then attack with all your might.

00:25:21.540 --> 00:25:27.080
These are the fundamentals to kill a
player that Punitto Moe-san created.

00:25:27.080 --> 00:25:28.640
Locate Object!

00:25:32.720 --> 00:25:34.160
It's here.

00:25:34.160 --> 00:25:36.220
I think that area is a cemetery, right?

00:25:36.970 --> 00:25:41.540
Next, use Clairvoyance and
Crystal Monitor at the same time,

00:25:41.540 --> 00:25:43.230
and show them to me.

00:25:43.230 --> 00:25:44.470
Clairvoyance.

00:25:44.470 --> 00:25:45.890
Crystal Monitor.

00:25:50.110 --> 00:25:51.920
A crowd of undead.

00:25:51.920 --> 00:25:53.320
It's confirmed then.

00:25:53.840 --> 00:25:57.160
And the people who took
the plates are close by.

00:25:58.550 --> 00:26:03.290
Then again, we don't have enough
time to gather any more information.

00:26:04.440 --> 00:26:05.540
We're done.

00:26:05.540 --> 00:26:07.330
Did you figure something out?

00:26:07.330 --> 00:26:09.320
They're based in the cemetery.

00:26:09.320 --> 00:26:10.730
My grandson is there too?

00:26:10.730 --> 00:26:14.420
Yes. He's in the middle
of a crowd of undead.

00:26:15.590 --> 00:26:17.290
Don't be so surprised.

00:26:17.290 --> 00:26:21.710
However, the crowd of undead
may break out of the cemetery.

00:26:21.710 --> 00:26:26.070
Tell the guild and the
townspeople about that, Lizzy.

00:26:26.070 --> 00:26:29.360
Nabe and I will go to the
cemetery immediately.

00:26:29.360 --> 00:26:34.030
You have a way to break
through a crowd of undead?

00:26:35.710 --> 00:26:37.550
I have it right here.

00:26:44.240 --> 00:26:46.420
An army of undead!

00:26:46.420 --> 00:26:49.300
There are over a hundred,
no, over two hundred!

00:26:49.300 --> 00:26:50.880
Maybe a thousand?!

00:26:50.880 --> 00:26:53.170
Let the soldiers at the station know!

00:26:53.170 --> 00:26:56.380
We'll have to do something
until they get here!

00:27:25.790 --> 00:27:29.670
R-Retreat. Retreat!

00:27:35.160 --> 00:27:36.760
An adventurer.

00:27:37.170 --> 00:27:40.970
However, a Copper Plate won't help us.

00:27:41.410 --> 00:27:43.470
You guys need to get away from here!

00:27:46.150 --> 00:27:47.810
Nabe. My sword.

00:27:48.430 --> 00:27:50.440
You've left your backs unguarded.

00:28:03.810 --> 00:28:05.540
Who in the world are you?

00:28:06.720 --> 00:28:08.120
Open the gates!

00:28:08.120 --> 00:28:09.410
Don't be stupid!

00:28:09.410 --> 00:28:12.040
There's an army of
undead behind the gates.

00:28:12.460 --> 00:28:13.430
So what?

00:28:13.430 --> 00:28:16.420
Is that supposed to be a problem
for me, Momon, the great?

00:28:17.660 --> 00:28:18.870
That's fine.

00:28:18.870 --> 00:28:22.930
If you don't want to open the
gates, then I've got no choice.

00:28:27.770 --> 00:28:28.770
Nabe-dono!

00:28:28.770 --> 00:28:31.010
Don't leave me behind!

00:28:31.010 --> 00:28:35.310
I will follow you, Master!

00:29:05.930 --> 00:29:08.430
Summon Mid-Tier Undead!

00:29:08.910 --> 00:29:10.360
Jack the Ripper!

00:29:11.400 --> 00:29:13.000
Corpse Collector!

00:29:16.010 --> 00:29:16.900
Do it!

00:29:23.800 --> 00:29:25.620
Amazing...

00:29:26.320 --> 00:29:28.620
Well then, shall we go?

00:29:43.490 --> 00:29:48.510
Master, don't leave me
alone in a place like this!

00:29:48.840 --> 00:29:50.510
Khajiit-san, they're here.

00:29:51.120 --> 00:29:52.890
I've found an idiot.

00:29:53.720 --> 00:29:56.770
Hey, it sure is a nice night, Khajiit.

00:29:59.150 --> 00:30:02.400
Isn't it a waste to spend it
doing some boring ritual?

00:30:03.550 --> 00:30:07.790
I get to decide whether it's a
fitting night for a ritual or not.

00:30:07.790 --> 00:30:10.660
More importantly, who are you?

00:30:11.010 --> 00:30:13.750
We're adventurers who
accepted a request.

00:30:13.750 --> 00:30:16.430
We're looking for a young boy.

00:30:16.430 --> 00:30:18.670
I don't think I need to tell you who.

00:30:19.620 --> 00:30:26.720
Besides, I'm sure one of your
friends has a piercing weapon.

00:30:26.720 --> 00:30:28.450
Are you planning to lay low?

00:30:28.450 --> 00:30:32.460
Or maybe you're just scared of us?

00:30:33.910 --> 00:30:36.160
So you examined the corpses.

00:30:36.160 --> 00:30:37.400
Good job.

00:30:37.840 --> 00:30:38.940
You...

00:30:38.940 --> 00:30:41.870
Well, it looks like they figured it out.

00:30:41.870 --> 00:30:44.190
There's no point in hiding any longer.

00:30:44.750 --> 00:30:48.610
Well then. Can we
please hear your name?

00:30:48.610 --> 00:30:50.440
I'm Clementine.

00:30:50.440 --> 00:30:51.580
Nice to meet you.

00:30:51.580 --> 00:30:54.450
There's no point in telling
you, but I'm Momon.

00:30:54.860 --> 00:30:56.180
You're right.

00:30:56.180 --> 00:30:59.400
But how did you find this place?

00:30:59.400 --> 00:31:01.670
The answer is under that cloak.

00:31:01.670 --> 00:31:02.920
Show it to me.

00:31:03.750 --> 00:31:04.790
You pervert!

00:31:04.790 --> 00:31:06.450
Dirty old man!

00:31:06.450 --> 00:31:07.680
Just kidding.

00:31:07.680 --> 00:31:09.890
Are you talking about these?

00:31:12.010 --> 00:31:15.640
I found your location with those.

00:31:17.140 --> 00:31:18.090
Nabe.

00:31:18.090 --> 00:31:18.820
Yes.

00:31:18.820 --> 00:31:21.650
Deal with Khajiit and the other men.

00:31:22.030 --> 00:31:24.650
I'll take care of this woman.

00:31:24.650 --> 00:31:26.030
Understood.

00:31:26.680 --> 00:31:28.700
Keep an eye on the sky.

00:31:28.700 --> 00:31:29.650
Certainly.

00:31:31.020 --> 00:31:32.550
Clementine.

00:31:32.550 --> 00:31:35.470
Why don't we fight to
the death over there?

00:31:36.560 --> 00:31:38.180
Okay!

00:31:42.660 --> 00:31:44.460
This woman?

00:31:46.050 --> 00:31:48.330
Twin Maximize Magic!

00:31:48.970 --> 00:31:49.970
What?!

00:31:49.970 --> 00:31:52.720
Electrosphere!

00:32:03.710 --> 00:32:05.110
What an idiot.

00:32:05.110 --> 00:32:06.440
Good grief.

00:32:06.440 --> 00:32:10.150
You would've been better off
getting smashed like a maggot.

00:32:14.060 --> 00:32:18.050
Now that you mention it, are the
ones I killed in that shop your friends?

00:32:18.050 --> 00:32:21.170
Are you mad because
I killed your friends?

00:32:22.210 --> 00:32:25.440
That magic caster was hilarious!

00:32:25.440 --> 00:32:28.870
She kept believing that someone was
going to help them until the end!

00:32:28.870 --> 00:32:31.300
I'm sorry, I killed her!

00:32:31.760 --> 00:32:33.930
You don't really have to apologize.

00:32:34.820 --> 00:32:36.650
Really? That's kind of a shame.

00:32:36.650 --> 00:32:42.560
People who go all \"How dare you
kill my friends?!\" are fun to kill.

00:32:42.560 --> 00:32:45.990
Why aren't you angry? How boring!

00:32:45.990 --> 00:32:48.590
Well, I guess they weren't
really your allies after all?

00:32:50.550 --> 00:32:55.250
I would probably do something similar
to you, depending on the situation.

00:32:55.250 --> 00:32:58.580
That's why I think it would
be selfish to judge you.

00:32:58.580 --> 00:33:03.330
However, those people were
merely tools to spread my fame.

00:33:04.010 --> 00:33:09.090
You interrupted my plans, so your
existence is unpleasant for me.

00:33:11.130 --> 00:33:12.720
Ah, I see.

00:33:12.720 --> 00:33:15.720
By the way, is that beauty
a magic caster too?

00:33:15.720 --> 00:33:18.010
If she is, she'll never beat Khajiit-san.

00:33:18.010 --> 00:33:20.640
Though, she couldn't beat
someone like me either.

00:33:21.020 --> 00:33:23.980
I think even Nabe would be
able to beat someone like you.

00:33:23.980 --> 00:33:25.590
What an idiot.

00:33:25.590 --> 00:33:28.400
I slice and stab magic casters.

00:33:28.900 --> 00:33:31.250
That's how it always goes!

00:33:31.250 --> 00:33:32.320
I see.

00:33:32.320 --> 00:33:35.500
The only people in this
country who could fight me

00:33:35.500 --> 00:33:38.670
would be a member of the Blue Rose
and a member of the Red Drops.

00:33:38.670 --> 00:33:42.960
And maybe Gazef Stronoff
and Brain Unglaus?

00:33:44.140 --> 00:33:45.760
You just told me something useful.

00:33:45.760 --> 00:33:48.530
I'll give you a handicap.

00:33:48.530 --> 00:33:51.590
That will be my revenge against you.

00:33:52.840 --> 00:33:58.880
I don't know what kind of shit
face you have under your helmet,

00:33:58.880 --> 00:34:03.060
but there's no way
that Clementine-sama,

00:34:03.060 --> 00:34:05.440
who reached the Realm
of Heroes, would lose!

00:34:06.480 --> 00:34:08.940
That's exactly why I'm
giving you a handicap.

00:34:08.940 --> 00:34:13.570
I'm not fighting you
seriously, no matter what!

00:34:15.420 --> 00:34:18.570
You're just an idiot who can
use up to 3rd Tier magic.

00:34:18.880 --> 00:34:19.860
An idiot?

00:34:19.860 --> 00:34:22.450
A filthy human is calling me an idiot?

00:34:22.900 --> 00:34:28.200
What's wrong with calling a fool
who messes with my plans an idiot?

00:34:28.200 --> 00:34:31.220
Not to mention, you're recklessly
jumping straight in here

00:34:31.220 --> 00:34:34.450
without understanding our might.

00:34:34.450 --> 00:34:38.250
Take a good look at this
supreme orb's power!

00:34:41.730 --> 00:34:43.720
\"Keep an eye on the sky.\"

00:35:10.210 --> 00:35:14.080
The Skeletal Dragon has
complete magic resistance.

00:35:14.080 --> 00:35:19.010
It's an enemy against which Magic
Casters can't help but tremble with fear.

00:35:24.010 --> 00:35:25.330
In that case,

00:35:26.840 --> 00:35:28.350
I'll just beat it to death.

00:35:40.280 --> 00:35:42.200
How is that possible?!

00:35:43.660 --> 00:35:46.950
Y-You... what are you?!

00:35:47.270 --> 00:35:48.370
Are you a Mithril plate?

00:35:48.370 --> 00:35:51.250
No, an Orichalcum adventurer?!

00:35:53.040 --> 00:35:57.670
If this bothers you so much, I can only
describe you as an inferior life form.

00:35:57.670 --> 00:35:58.760
You red click beetle.

00:35:59.190 --> 00:36:01.260
Y-You bastard...

00:36:03.760 --> 00:36:05.720
I won't let you! I won't let you!

00:36:05.720 --> 00:36:06.930
I won't let you do it!

00:36:07.550 --> 00:36:10.040
Ray of Negative Energy!

00:36:21.030 --> 00:36:22.490
Reinforce Armor!

00:36:22.910 --> 00:36:24.410
Lesser Strength!

00:36:24.930 --> 00:36:26.650
Shield Wall!

00:36:26.650 --> 00:36:28.570
Undead Flame!

00:36:29.620 --> 00:36:31.410
Reinforce Armor.

00:36:31.410 --> 00:36:32.860
Shield Wall.

00:36:32.860 --> 00:36:35.380
Protection Energy Negative.

00:36:53.440 --> 00:36:55.940
Acid Javelin!

00:36:59.940 --> 00:37:01.530
Defensive magic, huh?

00:37:01.530 --> 00:37:02.610
How annoying.

00:37:02.980 --> 00:37:04.310
Lightning!

00:37:08.540 --> 00:37:11.830
I'm the one getting
annoyed, you bagworm.

00:37:11.830 --> 00:37:14.290
Why don't you stop hiding
behind that dragon and face me?

00:37:16.010 --> 00:37:18.060
It can't be helped.

00:37:18.060 --> 00:37:20.170
Orb of Death!

00:37:22.130 --> 00:37:26.140
Take a good look at the
power of the Orb of Death!

00:37:40.290 --> 00:37:41.740
A second one...

00:37:44.390 --> 00:37:48.360
I may have used up all
of my energy with this...

00:37:48.360 --> 00:37:49.990
But once I kill you,

00:37:49.990 --> 00:37:52.790
and I bring death to this city,

00:37:52.790 --> 00:37:56.000
I'm sure I'll make up my losses.

00:38:03.300 --> 00:38:05.550
I'm so tired!

00:38:07.340 --> 00:38:10.900
You may have some incredible strength,

00:38:10.900 --> 00:38:13.560
so of course you'd
want to boast about it!

00:38:14.240 --> 00:38:15.940
But, say...

00:38:15.940 --> 00:38:17.400
Are you an idiot?

00:38:17.400 --> 00:38:21.940
Aren't you just some dead
weight swinging a sword around?

00:38:22.380 --> 00:38:25.070
Aren't you underestimating me?

00:38:25.070 --> 00:38:27.660
In that case, come and attack me.

00:38:27.660 --> 00:38:30.660
You've just been evading
my attacks all this time.

00:38:30.660 --> 00:38:33.540
If only I could do that...

00:38:33.540 --> 00:38:38.580
What happened to your confidence
that you could beat any warrior?

00:38:50.950 --> 00:38:52.950
A Skeletal Dragon, huh...

00:38:52.950 --> 00:38:55.850
Correct! You know your stuff.

00:38:55.850 --> 00:38:57.700
It's unaffected by magic,

00:38:57.700 --> 00:39:00.540
so it's the worst enemy
for a magic caster.

00:39:00.540 --> 00:39:01.920
I see.

00:39:01.920 --> 00:39:04.880
Is that the reason Nabe won't win?

00:39:04.880 --> 00:39:06.400
That's right.

00:39:07.120 --> 00:39:07.910
So?

00:39:08.550 --> 00:39:12.030
Do you have any way to close this gap?

00:39:12.740 --> 00:39:14.080
Who knows?

00:39:30.760 --> 00:39:32.140
Invulnerable Fortress.

00:39:41.780 --> 00:39:42.690
Martial Arts, huh?

00:39:43.170 --> 00:39:45.260
How hard...

00:39:45.260 --> 00:39:46.870
Well, whatever.

00:39:46.870 --> 00:39:51.880
In that case, I'll just attack places
where the armor is thinner.

00:39:51.880 --> 00:39:58.230
I wanted to cut you up little by little
and play around with you, though.

00:39:58.230 --> 00:40:00.330
That's such a shame.

00:40:00.880 --> 00:40:03.780
So you purposefully
aimed at my shoulder.

00:40:03.780 --> 00:40:05.460
Thank you for the demonstration.

00:40:05.460 --> 00:40:07.840
Here I come, then.

00:40:11.760 --> 00:40:12.890
Invulnerable Fortress.

00:40:14.730 --> 00:40:15.850
Flow Acceleration!

00:40:25.580 --> 00:40:28.910
If you give me a handicap or
whatever and don't fight seriously,

00:40:28.910 --> 00:40:30.400
aren't you going to die?

00:40:31.200 --> 00:40:32.710
Good grief...

00:40:32.710 --> 00:40:35.910
I'm learning a lot of
new things in this fight.

00:40:35.910 --> 00:40:38.450
I've learned about the
existence of Martial Arts,

00:40:38.450 --> 00:40:41.330
and the importance of
balance when you strike.

00:40:42.690 --> 00:40:44.390
You only just realized that?

00:40:44.390 --> 00:40:46.290
What a disappointing warrior.

00:40:46.290 --> 00:40:50.870
But how did you not take any
damage from that attack just now?

00:40:52.670 --> 00:40:54.600
Was that a Martial Arts defense skill?

00:40:55.240 --> 00:40:58.630
Well, I've learned a lot.

00:40:58.630 --> 00:40:59.600
I must thank you.

00:41:00.470 --> 00:41:03.280
But time is running out.

00:41:03.280 --> 00:41:06.200
I think we can stop playing around now.

00:41:07.780 --> 00:41:09.360
Narberal Gamma!

00:41:09.770 --> 00:41:12.240
Show them the power of Nazarick!

00:41:15.520 --> 00:41:16.660
What does that mean?

00:41:18.270 --> 00:41:23.460
Alright then, attack me and
prepare yourself to die!

00:41:31.990 --> 00:41:35.140
I might spare your life if you surrender.

00:41:37.360 --> 00:41:39.270
You filthy human.

00:41:39.270 --> 00:41:40.390
What?

00:41:40.390 --> 00:41:43.390
Don't underestimate me,
you piece of trash.

00:41:44.680 --> 00:41:46.900
Crush her, Skeletal Dragons!

00:41:50.300 --> 00:41:51.650
Narberal Gamma!

00:41:53.220 --> 00:41:55.530
Show them the power of Nazarick!

00:41:59.420 --> 00:42:01.180
Your wish is my command.

00:42:02.240 --> 00:42:04.590
Well then, I'm no longer fighting as Nabe,

00:42:04.590 --> 00:42:07.790
but Narberal Gamma.

00:42:13.010 --> 00:42:14.540
Teleportation.

00:42:27.330 --> 00:42:28.260
Fly.

00:42:31.730 --> 00:42:32.570
She disappeared?

00:42:32.930 --> 00:42:34.160
Where did she go?

00:42:38.350 --> 00:42:40.980
I never suspected she
could use Fly magic.

00:42:41.650 --> 00:42:45.310
How did she manage to
escape from that attack?

00:42:46.680 --> 00:42:49.610
Besides, even though she can use Fly,

00:42:49.610 --> 00:42:52.340
she's not running away
from the Skeletal Dragons.

00:42:52.340 --> 00:42:58.090
Does that mean she found a way to beat
the magic immune Skeletal Dragons?

00:42:58.090 --> 00:43:01.210
There are several different
ways to beat them.

00:43:01.210 --> 00:43:02.530
But first...

00:43:08.360 --> 00:43:11.640
Rejoice, you filthy human.

00:43:11.640 --> 00:43:14.830
From the Great Tomb of Nazarick,

00:43:14.830 --> 00:43:19.040
loyal to the Supreme Ruler,
Ainz Ooal Gown-sama,

00:43:19.040 --> 00:43:25.930
your opponent will be one of the Pleiades
battle maids, Narberal Gamma.

00:43:27.100 --> 00:43:28.560
Maid?

00:43:29.500 --> 00:43:30.750
Skeletal Dragons!

00:43:32.260 --> 00:43:33.250
What?!

00:43:43.520 --> 00:43:45.270
Does it hurt that much?

00:43:49.350 --> 00:43:51.190
Teleportation magic?

00:43:51.190 --> 00:43:55.660
So your trump card was
killing me after teleporting?

00:43:55.660 --> 00:43:57.820
Not at all.

00:43:58.490 --> 00:44:03.330
I just wanted to show you
that I could kill you that easily.

00:44:04.240 --> 00:44:06.830
Are you crazy?

00:44:06.830 --> 00:44:09.980
While I understand you're just a
flea, what kind of retort is that?

00:44:09.980 --> 00:44:13.420
You should use your head a little more.

00:44:13.420 --> 00:44:15.170
Damn you...

00:44:15.170 --> 00:44:17.460
It's time to end this already.

00:44:17.460 --> 00:44:22.630
It would be rude of me, as a follower of
the great Ainz-sama, if I made him wait.

00:44:24.160 --> 00:44:28.440
You think that magic doesn't
work on Skeletal Dragons.

00:44:28.440 --> 00:44:31.710
So let me teach an amoeba like you a lesson.

00:44:32.440 --> 00:44:35.980
The payment is your worthless existence.

00:44:39.830 --> 00:44:42.280
What kind of magic is that?!

00:44:44.360 --> 00:44:48.830
But still... Skeletal Dragons
have full resistance to magic.

00:44:49.240 --> 00:44:51.240
Full resistance?

00:44:51.240 --> 00:44:56.750
However, that's just a power that repels
6th Tier and lower magic spells.

00:44:57.420 --> 00:45:00.210
If any attack above that hits it,

00:45:00.210 --> 00:45:04.760
then I, Narberal Gamma, would
break through its immunity.

00:45:05.110 --> 00:45:06.200
What an idiot!

00:45:06.200 --> 00:45:11.250
No human in this world
can use any 7th Tier magic!

00:45:14.210 --> 00:45:18.070
Good job becoming a
stepping stone for Ainz-sama.

00:45:18.760 --> 00:45:21.240
Twin Maximize Magic.

00:45:21.240 --> 00:45:23.600
Chain Dragon Lightning!

00:45:47.300 --> 00:45:50.470
Insects smell lovely after being roasted.

00:45:51.580 --> 00:45:53.950
Maybe this would be a
good souvenir for Entoma.

00:45:56.080 --> 00:45:58.670
What are you doing?

00:45:58.670 --> 00:46:00.780
Did you give up?

00:46:01.370 --> 00:46:03.550
After giving Narberal her orders,

00:46:03.550 --> 00:46:07.030
I was thinking I should get
this over with already.

00:46:08.360 --> 00:46:10.540
Are you speaking seriously, you bastard?

00:46:10.870 --> 00:46:13.540
Even though you don't
have any Martial Arts?

00:46:13.540 --> 00:46:16.240
You think you can beat
Clementine-sama?!

00:46:16.240 --> 00:46:18.700
I can't get more pissed off than this!

00:46:18.700 --> 00:46:22.170
It's impressive how much
the weak ramble on.

00:46:24.420 --> 00:46:26.970
At least I agree that we
should get this over with.

00:46:27.890 --> 00:46:29.600
Pace of the Wind.

00:46:29.600 --> 00:46:30.640
Greater Evasion.

00:46:31.040 --> 00:46:32.520
Ability Boost.

00:46:32.520 --> 00:46:34.840
Greater Ability Boost.

00:46:37.020 --> 00:46:38.520
He's not doing anything?

00:46:39.520 --> 00:46:41.030
Die!

00:46:43.950 --> 00:46:47.200
I'm not done yet!

00:46:54.390 --> 00:46:55.690
I see.

00:46:55.690 --> 00:46:58.500
Weapons like these
didn't exist in Yggdrasil.

00:46:59.090 --> 00:47:00.920
You've been an excellent teacher.

00:47:00.920 --> 00:47:02.510
No way!

00:47:03.120 --> 00:47:04.880
Wh-Why aren't you dead?!

00:47:05.220 --> 00:47:07.220
Let me answer your question.

00:47:09.090 --> 00:47:10.050
Undead?!

00:47:10.550 --> 00:47:11.930
An elder lich?!

00:47:12.720 --> 00:47:15.640
Well, let's say you're almost right.

00:47:16.420 --> 00:47:18.160
So, how was it?

00:47:18.160 --> 00:47:21.150
Did you enjoy fighting a
magic caster with a sword?

00:47:21.150 --> 00:47:24.560
Don't underestimate me!

00:47:25.330 --> 00:47:26.450
Wh-Why?

00:47:27.040 --> 00:47:29.200
This is my real handicap.

00:47:29.950 --> 00:47:34.670
I didn't need to fight you seriously.

00:47:34.670 --> 00:47:39.920
In other words, you're not an
opponent worthy of my magic.

00:47:40.330 --> 00:47:42.920
You bastard!

00:47:42.920 --> 00:47:46.190
Well then, I told you the truth.

00:47:47.640 --> 00:47:49.300
These are in the way.

00:47:49.300 --> 00:47:51.050
Shit! You can't be serious!

00:47:51.660 --> 00:47:53.430
Alright, let's get started.

00:47:56.180 --> 00:47:58.270
No way. No way!

00:47:58.270 --> 00:47:59.690
You bastard!

00:48:00.620 --> 00:48:02.570
If you had been even weaker,

00:48:03.000 --> 00:48:06.210
I was thinking of killing you with this.

00:48:07.190 --> 00:48:09.530
Well. Dying from a sword...

00:48:09.530 --> 00:48:11.680
Dying by getting split...

00:48:11.680 --> 00:48:13.690
Dying by getting crushed...

00:48:13.690 --> 00:48:15.700
They're not too different.

00:48:16.420 --> 00:48:17.790
In the end, you're still dead.

00:48:22.500 --> 00:48:24.450
Shit! You bastard!

00:48:24.450 --> 00:48:26.420
Don't flail around so much.

00:48:29.580 --> 00:48:34.850
You took your sweet
time killing them, right?

00:48:36.470 --> 00:48:40.730
So allow me to take my time
and do it slowly as well.

00:48:47.940 --> 00:48:49.900
The Dance of Death.

00:49:05.040 --> 00:49:07.710
I forgot to tell you.

00:49:07.710 --> 00:49:11.270
I'm a dreadful hypocrite.

00:49:22.270 --> 00:49:26.500
At the very least, I can cure
his blindness with magic,

00:49:26.500 --> 00:49:28.210
but more importantly...

00:49:28.210 --> 00:49:30.900
It seems like his mind is being controlled.

00:49:31.770 --> 00:49:34.240
This is clearly the cause.

00:49:36.220 --> 00:49:38.520
All Appraisal Magic Item.

00:49:40.730 --> 00:49:42.890
The Crown of Wisdom, huh?

00:49:42.890 --> 00:49:44.720
I see.

00:49:44.720 --> 00:49:48.000
An item that you can't
reproduce in Yggdrasil.

00:49:48.970 --> 00:49:51.700
I would like to take him in his
current state to Nazarick.

00:49:52.430 --> 00:49:54.790
But since I accepted the
request to rescue him,

00:49:54.790 --> 00:49:59.020
it would harm the name of
Ainz Ooal Gown if I failed.

00:49:59.800 --> 00:50:01.320
Crumble.

00:50:01.320 --> 00:50:03.020
Greater Break Item!

00:50:10.410 --> 00:50:12.150
Ainz-sama.

00:50:12.570 --> 00:50:17.160
Master. I, Hamsuke, pledge
my complete loyalty to you.

00:50:17.160 --> 00:50:18.270
I see.

00:50:20.370 --> 00:50:21.160
More importantly...

00:50:22.250 --> 00:50:24.280
We're making our triumphant return.

00:50:24.280 --> 00:50:31.390
Master! I'd like you to take my
pledge of loyalty more seriously.

00:50:33.370 --> 00:50:34.740
Message.

00:50:34.740 --> 00:50:36.250
Ainz-sama.

00:50:36.250 --> 00:50:37.540
Albedo?

00:50:37.540 --> 00:50:42.060
Shalltear Bloodfallen
has rebelled against us.

00:50:59.950 --> 00:51:03.230
Hey, hey. This looks pretty fun.

00:51:03.230 --> 00:51:05.410
Brain Unglaus.

00:51:05.410 --> 00:51:08.170
I hope you're able to entertain me.

00:51:08.170 --> 00:51:14.430
I am a cruel, cold and
horrible pretty little monster.

00:51:15.260 --> 00:51:20.010
But still, this nail clipper's
blade has gone dull.

00:51:21.720 --> 00:51:23.830
I'm an idiot...

00:51:26.280 --> 00:51:28.100
What? We're playing tag?

00:51:28.100 --> 00:51:31.440
Should we get this over with already?

00:51:33.730 --> 00:51:37.280
I remember, but...

00:51:38.540 --> 00:51:43.540
Hide and seek is next after tag?

00:51:44.800 --> 00:51:46.660
A lamprey!

00:51:50.820 --> 00:51:52.420
You won't run away!

00:51:55.320 --> 00:51:57.550
I think she's a vampire!

00:51:57.550 --> 00:51:59.090
Ready your weapons.

00:51:59.090 --> 00:52:01.020
I want to squash them!

00:52:01.020 --> 00:52:05.650
I want to tear them to pieces
and bathe in their blood!

00:52:23.620 --> 00:52:26.790
Go to that woman and capture her!

00:52:37.010 --> 00:52:38.490
Look into my eyes!

00:52:47.140 --> 00:52:49.160
How did you acquire this potion?

00:52:50.230 --> 00:52:55.190
I received it from a person wearing
a black armor at an E-Rantel inn.

00:52:55.750 --> 00:52:58.180
This woman became his disciple?

00:52:58.180 --> 00:53:01.620
No, they're probably just
friendly towards each other.

00:53:01.620 --> 00:53:03.700
Why did you come here?!

00:53:03.700 --> 00:53:08.660
We were looking for the soldiers
who became mercenaries.

00:53:09.440 --> 00:53:12.420
Something seemed strange
so we split the team...

00:53:12.420 --> 00:53:15.210
You split the team?

00:53:15.210 --> 00:53:16.740
Yes.

00:53:16.740 --> 00:53:21.470
We left one of our rangers behind
just in case of an emergency.

00:53:22.140 --> 00:53:24.600
I think he's heading
to E-Rantel right now.

00:53:31.890 --> 00:53:33.540
Crap!

00:53:33.540 --> 00:53:34.770
Wolves, come to me!

00:53:37.330 --> 00:53:41.030
Swallow every human inside that forest!

00:53:42.620 --> 00:53:45.330
Two humans managed to escape!

00:53:45.330 --> 00:53:47.590
Ainz-sama will definitely get mad at me!

00:53:50.420 --> 00:53:52.540
They defeated my cute puppies?

00:54:07.220 --> 00:54:08.510
Out of my way!

00:54:23.170 --> 00:54:24.740
Kaire-sama!

00:54:38.170 --> 00:54:42.340
I can't believe the situation forced
her to use her Divine Class Item.

00:54:45.320 --> 00:54:46.800
Where are you going?

00:54:47.840 --> 00:54:51.060
Call Yuri. I'm going to the treasure room.

00:54:58.940 --> 00:55:01.830
Is this your first time
here as well, Albedo?

00:55:01.830 --> 00:55:02.400
Yes.

00:55:02.920 --> 00:55:07.070
I can't enter without the
Ring of Ainz Ooal Gown.

00:55:07.070 --> 00:55:08.890
That's true.

00:55:17.280 --> 00:55:19.920
Hail Ainz Ooal Gown!

00:55:21.380 --> 00:55:22.670
I think it was...

00:55:22.670 --> 00:55:32.490
\"And thus thou shalt make the world's glory
thine, and rid all darkness from thyself.\"

00:55:32.490 --> 00:55:33.680
...maybe?

00:55:37.510 --> 00:55:40.190
We're going to the mausoleum.

00:55:40.630 --> 00:55:43.440
A mausoleum?

00:55:44.960 --> 00:55:46.950
You don't know about it?

00:55:47.480 --> 00:55:49.950
What about Pandora's Actor, then?

00:55:50.460 --> 00:55:54.700
I know of him because I'm his
superior, but I've never met him.

00:55:55.160 --> 00:55:57.140
Pandora's Actor.

00:55:57.140 --> 00:55:59.440
He works as the guardian
to the treasure room,

00:55:59.440 --> 00:56:03.710
and he rivals both Demiurge and
I in strength and intelligence.

00:56:04.560 --> 00:56:08.090
He was also created by
Ainz-sama personally.

00:56:08.710 --> 00:56:10.600
W-Well yeah...

00:56:10.600 --> 00:56:14.510
I do know he's the one in
charge of Nazarick's finances.

00:56:14.510 --> 00:56:15.350
Yeah.

00:56:23.900 --> 00:56:26.280
Tabula Smaragdina-sama?!

00:56:26.950 --> 00:56:27.810
No way...

00:56:27.810 --> 00:56:30.530
No, that's wrong. What are you?!

00:56:30.530 --> 00:56:33.750
Even if you take the form
of a Supreme Being,

00:56:33.750 --> 00:56:36.990
I would never mistake my creator!

00:56:39.240 --> 00:56:40.460
I see.

00:56:40.460 --> 00:56:41.610
Kill him!

00:56:41.610 --> 00:56:42.590
However...

00:56:42.590 --> 00:56:45.340
That's enough, Pandora's Actor.

00:56:52.620 --> 00:56:55.740
Welcome. Thank you for your visit.

00:56:59.070 --> 00:57:02.310
My creator, Momonga-sama!

00:57:02.310 --> 00:57:04.570
Y-You look fine as well.

00:57:04.570 --> 00:57:08.540
Yes! I'm doing fine.

00:57:08.540 --> 00:57:09.820
By the way,

00:57:11.360 --> 00:57:13.410
what brings you here this time?

00:57:13.410 --> 00:57:15.790
I came to pick up some World Items.

00:57:17.410 --> 00:57:19.540
World Items!

00:57:20.060 --> 00:57:21.460
They can change the world!

00:57:21.950 --> 00:57:23.580
With immense power!

00:57:23.580 --> 00:57:26.880
Fitting for the Supreme Being's greatness!

00:57:27.800 --> 00:57:31.050
Many treasures sleep
within Nazarick's chambers.

00:57:32.120 --> 00:57:35.300
Are you saying it is time
to release their power?

00:57:36.190 --> 00:57:37.950
He's so lame!

00:57:40.180 --> 00:57:42.720
Yes, that's right!

00:57:42.720 --> 00:57:46.140
I'm taking Greed and
Selflessness, Hygieia's Chalice,

00:57:46.140 --> 00:57:51.080
Billion Blades and Depiction
of Nature and Society.

00:57:51.080 --> 00:57:53.450
Yes! Understood, Momonga-sama!

00:57:53.450 --> 00:57:57.260
Also, from now on, call me Ainz.

00:57:57.260 --> 00:57:59.200
Ainz Ooal Gown.

00:58:00.430 --> 00:58:02.090
Understood.

00:58:02.090 --> 00:58:05.080
My creator, Ainz-sama!

00:58:06.130 --> 00:58:07.300
Stop it.

00:58:07.300 --> 00:58:10.090
Don't look at my dark past
with those deadpan eyes!

00:58:12.680 --> 00:58:14.110
That's right!

00:58:14.110 --> 00:58:17.880
I chose his outfit and actions
because I thought they were cool!

00:58:17.880 --> 00:58:22.570
Well, I think the military outfit
might still be a little cool, though...

00:58:22.570 --> 00:58:24.440
Is something wrong?!

00:58:27.690 --> 00:58:28.900
Well then, let's go.

00:58:28.900 --> 00:58:29.890
Yes.

00:58:30.740 --> 00:58:32.760
Come back later, Ainz-sama!

00:58:32.760 --> 00:58:34.820
And you ladies, too.

00:58:35.690 --> 00:58:37.370
Ladies?!

00:58:37.370 --> 00:58:39.370
Hey! Come here for a second!

00:58:40.750 --> 00:58:44.030
I'm your creator, right?!

00:58:44.030 --> 00:58:46.670
Exactly, Ainz-sama.

00:58:46.670 --> 00:58:51.170
In that case, here's an
order from your creator!

00:58:51.630 --> 00:58:53.570
Could you stop the salutes?

00:58:55.090 --> 00:58:56.570
Well, how should I say it?

00:58:56.570 --> 00:58:58.150
Don't you think it's weird?

00:58:58.150 --> 00:59:00.630
The military outfit is good
because you're strong.

00:59:00.630 --> 00:59:03.140
But let's stop saluting, okay?

00:59:05.220 --> 00:59:07.520
\"If that's my God's will!\"

00:59:08.610 --> 00:59:10.720
Was that German?!

00:59:10.720 --> 00:59:12.570
Don't do that in front of me either.

00:59:13.510 --> 00:59:14.240
Alright...

00:59:14.760 --> 00:59:16.570
I'm begging you here.

00:59:17.290 --> 00:59:22.320
I would've never expected that my calm emotions
would be stirred by something like this.

00:59:22.320 --> 00:59:25.250
It's even more embarrassing
than riding a huge hamster.

00:59:26.240 --> 00:59:28.880
Sorry for the wait, Albedo.

00:59:29.220 --> 00:59:30.000
It's okay!

00:59:30.570 --> 00:59:34.760
Give your Ring of Ainz Ooal Gown to Yuri.

00:59:40.630 --> 00:59:44.890
You can't enter the treasure
room without a guild ring.

00:59:45.300 --> 00:59:51.070
But if you leave the ring on when you
enter, you'll be attacked by the golems.

00:59:51.070 --> 00:59:52.280
That's our defense system.

00:59:53.100 --> 00:59:57.660
These golems were created to
look like the Supreme Beings.

00:59:57.660 --> 01:00:00.040
You noticed.

01:00:00.040 --> 01:00:04.160
I created them in memory
of my old comrades.

01:00:04.160 --> 01:00:06.410
But they look pretty clumsy, huh?

01:00:06.410 --> 01:00:07.920
Not at all.

01:00:07.920 --> 01:00:11.960
However, you called it a
mausoleum and they look similar.

01:00:11.960 --> 01:00:16.420
Could it be that the other Supreme
Beings have passed away?

01:00:16.830 --> 01:00:20.430
That's not exactly right.

01:00:20.920 --> 01:00:24.680
No, that could definitely be true.

01:00:25.380 --> 01:00:30.200
All of them left their equipment
and items to me and then retired.

01:00:33.300 --> 01:00:35.480
Well, I guess that's it.

01:00:36.350 --> 01:00:38.780
You told me that I could sell it,

01:00:39.750 --> 01:00:43.660
but I can't do something
like that, Peroroncino-san.

01:00:44.470 --> 01:00:46.800
Please come back anytime.

01:00:48.910 --> 01:00:55.550
But still, I want to believe that they
could be somewhere in this world.

01:00:57.740 --> 01:00:58.860
What is it?

01:00:59.570 --> 01:01:01.550
No, it's nothing!

01:01:04.910 --> 01:01:06.020
L-Look!

01:01:06.350 --> 01:01:08.290
There are some empty spots, right?

01:01:08.290 --> 01:01:11.500
I have plans to place a statue of
myself in one of them as well.

01:01:13.400 --> 01:01:16.810
Don't say things like that...

01:01:17.480 --> 01:01:18.990
Please don't say it!

01:01:22.540 --> 01:01:24.080
Ainz-sama...

01:01:24.080 --> 01:01:28.330
The merciful Ainz-sama who
stayed with us until the end.

01:01:29.370 --> 01:01:34.630
Please rule over us forever!

01:01:35.040 --> 01:01:38.010
I'm begging you from
the bottom of my heart.

01:01:38.520 --> 01:01:41.740
Please! Please!

01:01:57.310 --> 01:01:58.430
Forgive me.

01:01:59.730 --> 01:02:02.030
Ainz-sama! Please promise me.

01:02:02.540 --> 01:02:05.660
Please promise that you
won't throw us aside!

01:02:06.030 --> 01:02:07.770
I'm sorry, but...

01:02:07.770 --> 01:02:08.920
Why?!

01:02:08.920 --> 01:02:11.290
Why won't you promise it?!

01:02:11.290 --> 01:02:13.220
What's so wrong?

01:02:13.220 --> 01:02:16.830
If you could tell me, we
could take care of it!

01:02:16.830 --> 01:02:20.630
If it's me that's in the way, then I
will take my own life immediately!

01:02:20.630 --> 01:02:21.470
That's not it!

01:02:22.880 --> 01:02:23.990
Listen to me.

01:02:24.890 --> 01:02:29.330
The World Item that's controlling
Shalltear's mind is absolute.

01:02:29.330 --> 01:02:30.910
In order to defend ourselves from it,

01:02:30.910 --> 01:02:33.640
we're going to need
World Items ourselves.

01:02:34.290 --> 01:02:39.260
Th-That's exactly why we came to
pick up these World Items, right?

01:02:39.260 --> 01:02:40.320
That's right.

01:02:40.320 --> 01:02:43.150
But those are only for
the guardians to use.

01:02:44.760 --> 01:02:48.340
To be honest, there is one
way to save Shalltear.

01:02:48.340 --> 01:02:49.790
A-And that's...

01:02:49.790 --> 01:02:56.490
There are twenty World Items, known as
the Twenty, that have unrivaled powers.

01:02:56.490 --> 01:02:58.790
We have one of those in
the deepest section here.

01:02:59.790 --> 01:03:03.610
However, the Twenty
wield immense power,

01:03:03.610 --> 01:03:06.580
and they disappear after
being used just once.

01:03:06.580 --> 01:03:09.480
Now that we know World
Items exist in this world,

01:03:09.480 --> 01:03:12.790
and the enemy has one of them,

01:03:12.790 --> 01:03:15.880
I'm much more hesitant
to use that trump card.

01:03:16.740 --> 01:03:19.440
Damn it... I'm such a pathetic master.

01:03:19.440 --> 01:03:21.950
That's not true at all!

01:03:21.950 --> 01:03:26.340
The World Items were obtained through
the hard work of the Supreme Beings.

01:03:26.340 --> 01:03:29.700
I think their value far surpasses our own existence.

01:03:30.210 --> 01:03:31.730
Albedo.

01:03:31.730 --> 01:03:36.000
Let me explain why I
didn't answer you earlier.

01:03:36.880 --> 01:03:40.090
I plan to fight against
Shalltear all by myself.

01:03:41.170 --> 01:03:44.630
And I don't know if I'll survive that battle.

01:03:45.000 --> 01:03:46.190
Please wait!

01:03:46.190 --> 01:03:48.340
I understand you fighting Shalltear!

01:03:48.340 --> 01:03:50.640
I think leaving her would
be the most foolish option!

01:03:50.960 --> 01:03:55.120
But in that case, wouldn't it be better
to use our numbers against her?!

01:03:55.120 --> 01:03:58.200
Why are you saying you have
to fight her by yourself?!

01:03:58.200 --> 01:04:00.340
You're wrong, Albedo.

01:04:00.340 --> 01:04:01.270
It's just that...

01:04:02.720 --> 01:04:04.030
Let's see.

01:04:05.440 --> 01:04:07.150
I have three reasons.

01:04:07.150 --> 01:04:13.330
Number one: I have doubts that I
am an adequate ruler for Nazarick.

01:04:14.540 --> 01:04:19.240
When I realized that other Yggdrasil
players could exist in this world,

01:04:19.240 --> 01:04:21.960
I should have assumed
World Items did too.

01:04:22.730 --> 01:04:26.340
Does an idiot like that
have any value as a ruler?

01:04:26.750 --> 01:04:30.080
Ainz-sama, you have
value just by being here!

01:04:30.080 --> 01:04:34.410
Besides, unfitting as we may be,
let us support you unconditionally!

01:04:34.410 --> 01:04:38.520
My second reason is that there's
a good chance this is a trap.

01:04:38.990 --> 01:04:41.180
A... trap?

01:04:41.180 --> 01:04:46.680
There's a possibility that enemies
lie in wait, using Shalltear is bait.

01:04:46.680 --> 01:04:49.890
In that case, if I go by myself,

01:04:49.890 --> 01:04:53.080
the enemy might think that
we have hidden forces.

01:04:53.620 --> 01:04:55.540
And the last reason...

01:04:56.380 --> 01:04:58.460
I'm going to kill Shalltear.

01:04:58.460 --> 01:04:59.500
In that case...

01:04:59.500 --> 01:05:00.830
In that case I'll go!

01:05:01.310 --> 01:05:03.340
I'll kill Shalltear!

01:05:03.670 --> 01:05:05.840
Do you have any realistic
chance of winning?

01:05:07.450 --> 01:05:09.330
Shalltear is strong.

01:05:09.330 --> 01:05:11.880
That's exactly why it has to be me.

01:05:11.880 --> 01:05:16.850
The only one who can beat
Shalltear in single combat is me.

01:05:16.850 --> 01:05:22.330
It's true that you might be able to
defeat her with your equipment.

01:05:22.330 --> 01:05:25.650
Not only is Shalltear's
body optimized for battle,

01:05:25.650 --> 01:05:29.270
but she's also a holy magic caster,

01:05:29.270 --> 01:05:31.370
which is strong against the undead.

01:05:31.370 --> 01:05:34.170
In other words, I'm at a disadvantage.

01:05:34.170 --> 01:05:36.280
That's what you want to say?

01:05:36.280 --> 01:05:37.870
Unfortunately.

01:05:38.200 --> 01:05:42.630
Your thinking is correct, but at
the same time it's wrong, too.

01:05:43.040 --> 01:05:47.500
Your knowledge seems to be
limited to what we gave you.

01:05:48.130 --> 01:05:50.970
What do you mean?

01:05:51.720 --> 01:05:59.480
Let me show you why I am
the Supreme Ruler of Nazarick.

01:06:08.890 --> 01:06:11.110
Aura. Mare.

01:06:11.590 --> 01:06:14.670
This is the place we part ways.

01:06:14.670 --> 01:06:17.600
After that, scout the area for enemies.

01:06:17.600 --> 01:06:18.600
Yes!

01:06:18.600 --> 01:06:22.290
However, if the enemy
forces outnumber you,

01:06:22.290 --> 01:06:24.130
retreat to Nazarick immediately.

01:06:25.550 --> 01:06:27.250
Understood.

01:06:28.290 --> 01:06:29.630
Understood.

01:06:30.160 --> 01:06:33.390
Listen, you must retreat no matter what.

01:06:33.390 --> 01:06:37.370
That's also an important step for my plan.

01:06:37.370 --> 01:06:40.890
Also, the Depiction of
Nature and Society,

01:06:41.390 --> 01:06:45.650
and Greed and Selflessness I entrusted you
with are World Items valuable to Nazarick.

01:06:45.650 --> 01:06:48.580
You can't let them get taken from you.

01:06:48.580 --> 01:06:52.280
If it comes to it, value
them over your own lives.

01:06:52.280 --> 01:06:53.530
Yes!

01:06:54.350 --> 01:06:58.030
However, I confirmed it with magic.

01:06:58.030 --> 01:07:02.960
The owner of the World Item that's
controlling Shalltear is not here.

01:07:04.030 --> 01:07:05.680
What's going on?

01:07:08.960 --> 01:07:10.710
I've come back.

01:07:13.340 --> 01:07:17.550
So? Why did you let
Ainz-sama go by himself?

01:07:17.920 --> 01:07:20.790
It was Ainz-sama's own decision.

01:07:20.790 --> 01:07:22.180
And we have to...

01:07:22.180 --> 01:07:23.940
Why did you allow it to happen?!

01:07:24.460 --> 01:07:27.400
For all we know, Ainz-sama
could have been lying.

01:07:28.270 --> 01:07:30.760
I don't understand his profound thinking,

01:07:30.760 --> 01:07:32.570
but I'm sure you noticed as well!

01:07:33.250 --> 01:07:34.950
Yes, that's right.

01:07:35.300 --> 01:07:37.700
In that case, why did
you let Ainz-sama go?!

01:07:38.420 --> 01:07:43.740
When Ainz-sama went to
E-Rantel, you refused to accept it!

01:07:43.740 --> 01:07:46.580
So why did you bow to his will now?!

01:07:47.810 --> 01:07:51.840
Because Ainz-sama said that he was
going to defeat Shalltear by himself.

01:07:54.040 --> 01:08:00.430
I promise that I'll defeat
Shalltear and return here.

01:08:01.290 --> 01:08:04.090
There was some true
determination there.

01:08:04.090 --> 01:08:07.810
As a woman, irreverent
as it may have been,

01:08:07.810 --> 01:08:12.280
when the man I love is
determined like that,

01:08:12.280 --> 01:08:15.810
I don't have the courage
to keep arguing with him.

01:08:15.810 --> 01:08:22.490
Besides, I asked Ainz-sama to promise
me that he would return here.

01:08:22.490 --> 01:08:25.620
So you decided based on your
feelings and not on logic?

01:08:26.300 --> 01:08:30.060
Ainz-sama is the last
Supreme Ruler of this land!

01:08:30.060 --> 01:08:34.880
Our role is removing any sort of
threat that may befall upon him!

01:08:35.440 --> 01:08:39.260
Even if he complains or takes our
lives, we still must take action!

01:08:40.220 --> 01:08:41.960
Where are you going?

01:08:41.960 --> 01:08:43.520
That's obvious.

01:08:43.520 --> 01:08:44.770
I'm ordering my subordinat—

01:08:47.600 --> 01:08:48.390
I see.

01:08:49.100 --> 01:08:55.280
So that was the reason you made
me come here immediately, Albedo.

01:08:55.800 --> 01:08:56.650
Exactly.

01:08:56.970 --> 01:08:58.240
How foolish!

01:08:58.240 --> 01:09:01.090
What if Ainz-sama dies here?

01:09:01.090 --> 01:09:03.910
How will you take responsibility for this?!

01:09:04.360 --> 01:09:09.040
Ainz-sama is the last person
we can pledge our loyalty to.

01:09:09.360 --> 01:09:12.110
Ainz-sama will return.

01:09:12.110 --> 01:09:13.920
How can you guarantee that?!

01:09:14.590 --> 01:09:16.890
Believe in your master.

01:09:16.890 --> 01:09:20.180
That's also our duty as
one of their creations.

01:09:22.720 --> 01:09:24.530
By the way, Cocytus...

01:09:24.530 --> 01:09:28.060
How good do you think
Ainz-sama's chances are?

01:09:28.580 --> 01:09:30.550
Three to seven.

01:09:30.550 --> 01:09:33.310
Three being in Ainz-sama's favor.

01:09:35.090 --> 01:09:36.180
I see.

01:09:36.180 --> 01:09:38.320
In that case, let's watch closely.

01:09:38.900 --> 01:09:43.570
Let's watch Ainz-sama
overcome those odds.

01:09:45.130 --> 01:09:46.580
I'm an idiot.

01:09:47.440 --> 01:09:50.330
I know there's a better way to do this.

01:09:51.290 --> 01:09:53.790
I convinced Aura and Mare,

01:09:53.790 --> 01:09:56.840
but I'm sure Albedo saw through my lie.

01:09:57.800 --> 01:09:59.340
Even then...

01:09:59.340 --> 01:10:02.640
Don't you think you're
risking your life, Shalltear?

01:10:03.370 --> 01:10:08.020
We don't even know if you can
respawn just like in Yggdrasil.

01:10:08.020 --> 01:10:11.140
We're going to be battling
with our lives on the line...

01:10:12.100 --> 01:10:12.900
But...

01:10:13.330 --> 01:10:15.650
I'll kill Shalltear!

01:10:17.290 --> 01:10:21.320
I don't want to see you
guys killing each other.

01:10:22.760 --> 01:10:23.820
Besides...

01:10:27.370 --> 01:10:30.390
I am Ainz Ooal Gown.

01:10:30.390 --> 01:10:34.710
And with that name on
the line, I can't lose!

01:10:35.140 --> 01:10:37.530
Body of Effulgent Beryl!

01:10:41.930 --> 01:10:43.700
It's just as I thought.

01:10:43.700 --> 01:10:46.950
As long as I don't unleash a real attack,

01:10:46.950 --> 01:10:49.400
you won't go into attack mode.

01:10:49.400 --> 01:10:51.230
Just like a game.

01:10:52.580 --> 01:10:54.350
In that case, Shalltear...

01:10:54.350 --> 01:10:58.270
I'm sorry, but I'll have you wait a little
before we engage in true combat.

01:10:58.940 --> 01:10:59.960
Fly.

01:10:59.960 --> 01:11:02.020
Bless of Magic Caster.

01:11:02.020 --> 01:11:03.660
Infinity Wall.

01:11:03.660 --> 01:11:05.320
Magic Ward Holy.

01:11:05.320 --> 01:11:06.690
Life Essence.

01:11:06.690 --> 01:11:08.490
Greater Full Potential.

01:11:08.490 --> 01:11:09.610
Freedom.

01:11:09.610 --> 01:11:10.790
False Data Life.

01:11:11.090 --> 01:11:12.210
See Through.

01:11:12.210 --> 01:11:13.790
Paranormal Intuition.

01:11:13.790 --> 01:11:15.390
Greater Resistance.

01:11:15.390 --> 01:11:16.720
Mantle of Chaos.

01:11:16.720 --> 01:11:18.280
Indomitability.

01:11:18.280 --> 01:11:19.570
Sensor Boost.

01:11:19.570 --> 01:11:20.720
Greater Luck.

01:11:20.720 --> 01:11:21.880
Magic Boost.

01:11:21.880 --> 01:11:23.300
Dragonic Power.

01:11:23.300 --> 01:11:24.890
Greater Hardening.

01:11:24.890 --> 01:11:26.270
Heavenly Aura.

01:11:26.270 --> 01:11:27.560
Absorption.

01:11:27.560 --> 01:11:28.750
Penetrate Up.

01:11:28.750 --> 01:11:30.440
Greater Magic Shield.

01:11:30.440 --> 01:11:31.650
Mana Essence.

01:11:31.650 --> 01:11:34.840
Triplet Maximize Magic: Explode Mine.

01:11:34.840 --> 01:11:37.900
Triplet Magic: Greater Magic Seal.

01:11:37.900 --> 01:11:41.320
Triplet Maximize Boosted
Magic: Magic Arrow!

01:11:44.780 --> 01:11:46.340
Alright, let's get started.

01:11:48.900 --> 01:11:49.660
What's that?

01:11:50.060 --> 01:11:52.930
I-It's probably Super Tier Magic.

01:11:52.930 --> 01:11:55.670
It's magic that surpasses
10th Tier Magic, right?

01:11:58.430 --> 01:12:00.840
No enemies, huh?

01:12:00.840 --> 01:12:03.130
Or are they still lying in wait?

01:12:03.130 --> 01:12:05.880
This should be a good chance to attack.

01:12:06.490 --> 01:12:08.900
Good grief, what am I going to do?

01:12:14.000 --> 01:12:17.760
Momonga, I'm setting the time!

01:12:17.760 --> 01:12:19.650
Bukubukuchagama-san...

01:12:20.100 --> 01:12:23.150
Why can't I bring myself
to mute this watch?

01:12:33.190 --> 01:12:36.540
I'm going to borrow
strength from all of you.

01:12:39.940 --> 01:12:42.420
Well then, let's get going.

01:12:43.210 --> 01:12:46.790
Superior Tier Magic: Fallen Down!

01:13:17.460 --> 01:13:19.710
Ainz-sama!

01:13:19.710 --> 01:13:23.210
That really hurt!

01:13:23.810 --> 01:13:28.220
It was a pretty boring present,
but did you like it, Shalltear?

01:13:30.720 --> 01:13:32.720
Wonderful!

01:13:32.720 --> 01:13:37.810
Now I have to kill someone as
powerful as you, Ainz-sama.

01:13:38.270 --> 01:13:41.770
Hey, why are you still addressing me like that?

01:13:41.770 --> 01:13:44.390
This is fine, though. Right?

01:13:44.390 --> 01:13:46.900
You're a Supreme Being,

01:13:46.900 --> 01:13:50.280
so it's obvious that I'd call you Ainz-sama.

01:13:51.130 --> 01:13:53.570
Who's your current master?

01:13:53.990 --> 01:13:55.950
My master is...

01:13:57.480 --> 01:14:01.500
Why am I fighting you, Ainz-sama?

01:14:02.370 --> 01:14:04.290
No, that's wrong.

01:14:04.290 --> 01:14:06.090
Was it because I was attacked?

01:14:28.790 --> 01:14:33.320
If I get attacked, I should counter
it and destroy my opponent.

01:14:33.320 --> 01:14:34.120
Why?

01:14:35.620 --> 01:14:39.360
I don't really understand,

01:14:39.360 --> 01:14:42.590
but since I've been attacked,
I need to destroy you.

01:14:42.590 --> 01:14:43.760
I see.

01:14:43.760 --> 01:14:45.340
I understand.

01:14:46.100 --> 01:14:48.630
Your current state, that is.

01:14:48.630 --> 01:14:50.120
Hey, hey!

01:14:50.120 --> 01:14:52.720
What's wrong, Ainz-sama?

01:14:52.720 --> 01:14:55.220
You think you can beat me like that?

01:14:56.900 --> 01:15:00.170
Ainz Ooal Gown never loses.

01:15:00.170 --> 01:15:04.730
Shalltear, you're going
to bow down to me!

01:15:06.840 --> 01:15:09.860
That sure is scary!

01:15:10.630 --> 01:15:11.740
Watch out.

01:15:15.490 --> 01:15:17.870
I'm sorry, Shalltear.

01:15:17.870 --> 01:15:23.320
That's where I cast my Triplet
Maximize Magic: Explode Mine.

01:15:24.240 --> 01:15:28.130
Maximize Magic: Gravity Maelstrom.

01:15:29.010 --> 01:15:31.010
Wall of Stone!

01:15:33.630 --> 01:15:36.140
Maximize Magic: Hold of Rib.

01:15:40.410 --> 01:15:43.230
Shalltear, I forgot to tell you.

01:15:43.690 --> 01:15:46.950
I put traps in this area.

01:15:46.950 --> 01:15:49.230
Why don't you flap your
wings and come right here?

01:15:49.230 --> 01:15:50.880
Ainz-sama!

01:15:50.880 --> 01:15:53.680
I won't be tempted by
something like that.

01:15:53.680 --> 01:15:56.700
There are traps in the air as well, right?

01:15:56.700 --> 01:15:58.280
It was so obvious, huh?

01:15:58.280 --> 01:16:00.160
Yes, it was obvious.

01:16:00.470 --> 01:16:02.160
That's not true, obviously.

01:16:03.330 --> 01:16:05.730
I only used the mine traps.

01:16:05.730 --> 01:16:11.050
I can't afford to waste MP on spells
that may not give any results.

01:16:11.880 --> 01:16:16.630
How much damage will I deal
before I run out of MP?

01:16:17.550 --> 01:16:19.400
As expected of Ainz-sama.

01:16:19.400 --> 01:16:23.140
I won't even be able to close
in on him by attacking directly.

01:16:23.140 --> 01:16:29.160
However, Ainz-sama's strength as
a magic caster relies on his MP.

01:16:29.160 --> 01:16:31.460
If I manage to get his MP to run out,

01:16:31.460 --> 01:16:35.030
I'll win the fight early as
long as I rely on my HP.

01:16:35.710 --> 01:16:43.160
This Spuit Lance heals my own wounds
proportionally to the damage I deal my opponents.

01:16:43.760 --> 01:16:49.640
That's why he can't summon
a beast to fight against me.

01:16:49.640 --> 01:16:55.170
A weak monster is an
easy target for my lance.

01:16:56.520 --> 01:16:58.880
Poor Ainz-sama.

01:16:58.880 --> 01:17:03.190
He has to fight me all alone!

01:17:03.190 --> 01:17:06.060
However... Mana Essence!

01:17:06.780 --> 01:17:09.850
He really has an
incredible amount of MP.

01:17:09.850 --> 01:17:12.820
How did he obtain that much power?

01:17:13.320 --> 01:17:17.060
That being said, as a necromancer,

01:17:17.060 --> 01:17:19.320
Ainz-sama shouldn't
be an unbeatable foe.

01:17:20.000 --> 01:17:23.990
I wonder why he's not wearing
his usual Divine-class items.

01:17:24.570 --> 01:17:27.790
This staring contest isn't
accomplishing anything.

01:17:27.790 --> 01:17:31.070
I should heal myself
before the battle starts.

01:17:31.070 --> 01:17:32.250
Regenerate.

01:17:32.250 --> 01:17:34.440
I won't even give you time to heal!

01:17:34.440 --> 01:17:37.840
Maximize Magic, Gravity Maelstrom!

01:17:37.840 --> 01:17:40.020
Greater Teleportation!

01:17:42.930 --> 01:17:44.760
Delay Teleportation?

01:17:45.860 --> 01:17:47.390
Drifting Master Mine!

01:17:49.940 --> 01:17:50.950
How naive!

01:17:50.950 --> 01:17:54.440
Maximize Magic: Astral Smite!

01:17:58.440 --> 01:18:01.450
Maximize Magic: Thousand Bone Lance!

01:18:03.680 --> 01:18:05.700
Greater Teleportation!

01:18:05.700 --> 01:18:06.700
You're not getting away!

01:18:07.270 --> 01:18:09.370
Impure Shockwave Shield!

01:18:09.370 --> 01:18:10.370
What?!

01:18:10.900 --> 01:18:15.710
Ainz-sama, did you not
know I had a skill like that?

01:18:17.320 --> 01:18:18.710
I had never seen it before!

01:18:20.400 --> 01:18:23.970
I wonder how long you'll be able
to keep bluffing, Ainz-sama?

01:18:26.320 --> 01:18:29.980
This is called a Purifying Javelin.

01:18:29.980 --> 01:18:32.100
An object summoning skill, huh?

01:18:39.030 --> 01:18:43.280
That's a holy element
weapon against magic users!

01:18:43.280 --> 01:18:47.030
It looks extremely effective, right?

01:18:48.580 --> 01:18:50.050
Don't underestimate me!

01:18:50.050 --> 01:18:53.540
Maximize Magic, Reality Slash!

01:18:59.370 --> 01:19:01.820
That's not any regular healing magic.

01:19:01.820 --> 01:19:02.720
What did you do?!

01:19:03.240 --> 01:19:06.580
Don't get so surprised, Ainz-sama!

01:19:06.580 --> 01:19:08.560
This is a skill as well.

01:19:08.560 --> 01:19:11.150
Don't think that I'm cheating.

01:19:11.150 --> 01:19:15.080
This is a power bestowed to
me by Pereroncino-sama.

01:19:15.080 --> 01:19:19.610
Maybe it's proof that he
was much greater than you?

01:19:20.250 --> 01:19:22.400
Seems like that's how you really feel.

01:19:23.610 --> 01:19:25.130
Here I go, Shalltear!

01:19:25.130 --> 01:19:27.760
You can use any skill you like,

01:19:27.760 --> 01:19:30.290
but I'll prove my magic is still superior!

01:19:31.320 --> 01:19:33.800
Are you challenging me to a shoot-out?

01:19:33.800 --> 01:19:35.420
In that case, I won't lose!

01:19:35.930 --> 01:19:38.290
Though I can only use these
skills a set number of times.

01:19:38.660 --> 01:19:41.880
Maximize Magic: Reality Slash!

01:19:41.880 --> 01:19:44.130
Purifying Javelin!

01:19:45.050 --> 01:19:48.350
I'm sure you've already
used up a lot of your MP!

01:19:50.300 --> 01:19:54.900
I'm almost out of skill uses,
but I still have MP to spare!

01:19:54.900 --> 01:19:57.720
Then how about this?!

01:19:57.720 --> 01:20:01.360
Maximize Magic: Vermilion Nova!

01:20:01.360 --> 01:20:05.110
Triplet Maximize Magic:
Call Greater Thunder!

01:20:12.150 --> 01:20:15.080
He's not affected by fire attacks?

01:20:15.490 --> 01:20:16.810
Ainz-sama!

01:20:16.810 --> 01:20:19.590
You've prepared counters
against fire, right?

01:20:20.170 --> 01:20:22.590
Compensating for your
weaknesses is basic.

01:20:22.920 --> 01:20:27.030
But it should be impossible to
prepare counters for all elements.

01:20:27.030 --> 01:20:30.450
In that case, I just need to
check what his weakness is.

01:20:30.450 --> 01:20:33.350
Maximize Magic: Brilliant Radiance!

01:20:33.350 --> 01:20:36.100
Maximize Magic: True Dark!

01:20:41.520 --> 01:20:44.280
So that's your weakness,
right, Ainz-sama?!

01:20:45.900 --> 01:20:48.280
Cocytus! What does this mean?!

01:20:49.080 --> 01:20:51.780
For an undead like Ainz-sama,

01:20:51.780 --> 01:20:55.480
a holy element is his obvious weakness.

01:20:55.480 --> 01:20:58.200
Since he's using fire
countering equipment,

01:20:58.200 --> 01:21:00.920
he can't defend against this.

01:21:09.050 --> 01:21:12.640
Even using holy magic consecutively

01:21:12.640 --> 01:21:17.180
doesn't overcome Ainz-sama's
magical superiority.

01:21:17.180 --> 01:21:20.120
But I think he's used up a lot of his MP.

01:21:21.270 --> 01:21:23.650
Body of Effulgent Beryl!

01:21:24.080 --> 01:21:26.320
Defensive magic?

01:21:26.320 --> 01:21:28.280
But that's right!

01:21:28.810 --> 01:21:31.780
Let me attack you
physically from now on!

01:21:31.780 --> 01:21:34.160
What a disadvantageous battle...

01:21:35.610 --> 01:21:37.420
Ainz-sama?

01:21:38.600 --> 01:21:41.330
In that case, how about you retreat?

01:21:42.050 --> 01:21:44.170
Well, you're right...

01:21:44.820 --> 01:21:46.120
I'm just...

01:21:46.120 --> 01:21:49.970
I'm just extremely selfish, Shalltear.

01:21:50.710 --> 01:21:52.140
I don't want to run away.

01:21:53.040 --> 01:21:56.090
Maybe no one could understand that,

01:21:56.090 --> 01:22:01.420
but right now I've achieved complete
fulfillment as a guild leader.

01:22:01.420 --> 01:22:03.650
I wonder why...

01:22:04.480 --> 01:22:05.650
I'm...

01:22:06.050 --> 01:22:09.530
Even though I was
always the guild leader,

01:22:09.530 --> 01:22:12.910
I mostly handled business
and management.

01:22:12.910 --> 01:22:14.620
But as I am right now,

01:22:14.620 --> 01:22:17.410
I'm fighting for the sake of the guild.

01:22:18.220 --> 01:22:21.170
It may just be my self-satisfaction.

01:22:21.170 --> 01:22:24.920
Is that what you'd call
the pride of a man?

01:22:25.460 --> 01:22:28.780
That might be it.

01:22:28.780 --> 01:22:33.260
Anyway, sorry for spoiling
the mood with my boring talk.

01:22:33.260 --> 01:22:34.930
Let's continue.

01:22:38.690 --> 01:22:39.980
Summon Household!

01:22:41.760 --> 01:22:43.330
Shark Cyclone!

01:22:57.540 --> 01:23:01.040
Body of Effulgent Beryl: Activate!

01:23:02.830 --> 01:23:04.950
Wall of Skeleton!

01:23:07.090 --> 01:23:10.590
Maximize Magic: Force Explosion!

01:23:13.210 --> 01:23:16.180
Greater Magic Seal: Release!

01:23:19.570 --> 01:23:21.490
Magic Destruction!

01:23:24.520 --> 01:23:25.650
Fly!

01:23:27.610 --> 01:23:29.280
She healed already!

01:23:29.660 --> 01:23:33.020
Triplet Maximize Magic: Reality Slash!

01:23:36.150 --> 01:23:38.620
Impure Shockwave Shield!

01:23:52.380 --> 01:23:55.220
It's time. It's finally time.

01:23:56.080 --> 01:23:58.640
Time for Shalltear's ultimate trump card!

01:24:01.830 --> 01:24:03.390
Einherjar!

01:24:05.140 --> 01:24:06.900
Summon Household.

01:24:15.420 --> 01:24:17.800
These numbers are a little troublesome.

01:24:17.800 --> 01:24:20.290
I have to take them out at
once with ranged magic,

01:24:21.010 --> 01:24:23.580
but what do I do about the Einherjar?

01:24:32.220 --> 01:24:33.410
That's dirty!

01:24:33.410 --> 01:24:35.710
No matter how legal friendly fire is,

01:24:35.710 --> 01:24:38.930
I never expected her to use
her own summons to heal!

01:24:48.740 --> 01:24:52.260
Skill: The Goal of All Life is Death!

01:24:53.400 --> 01:24:56.780
Widen Magic: Cry of the Banshee!

01:25:11.790 --> 01:25:12.800
This is the end.

01:25:34.590 --> 01:25:37.380
As expected of Ainz-sama.

01:25:37.380 --> 01:25:41.420
All my summoned monsters were killed.

01:25:41.420 --> 01:25:48.890
It's all thanks to a resurrection item that
Pereroncino-sama gave me that I'm alive.

01:25:48.890 --> 01:25:54.300
However, your MP must be
almost empty after that.

01:25:54.760 --> 01:25:59.270
On the other hand, my HP is full.

01:25:59.270 --> 01:26:00.430
That's right...

01:26:00.890 --> 01:26:02.540
Congratulations.

01:26:02.540 --> 01:26:08.370
Just like you, I have no MP left either,

01:26:08.370 --> 01:26:11.440
and I've used up most of my skills.

01:26:12.280 --> 01:26:15.440
You've put up a good fight so far.

01:26:16.160 --> 01:26:19.700
I hope that's honest praise.

01:26:22.070 --> 01:26:25.580
So, do you have any last words?

01:26:26.090 --> 01:26:27.880
That's right...

01:26:27.880 --> 01:26:30.390
I'm at a disadvantage,

01:26:30.390 --> 01:26:33.480
and with no MP left, I'm powerless.

01:26:33.480 --> 01:26:37.900
I have to thank you deeply
for not worrying about that

01:26:37.900 --> 01:26:41.090
and using all your power, Shalltear.

01:26:42.480 --> 01:26:44.880
If you had fought more carefully,

01:26:44.880 --> 01:26:48.810
I wouldn't have been able to get this far.

01:26:54.510 --> 01:26:59.390
In PVP, or Player Versus Player,

01:26:59.390 --> 01:27:03.030
the most important thing is how
well you can fool your enemy.

01:27:03.860 --> 01:27:06.430
For example, even though
you may have changed

01:27:06.430 --> 01:27:08.700
your equipment to be
resistant to holy attacks,

01:27:09.150 --> 01:27:11.710
you act as if they were strong.

01:27:11.710 --> 01:27:14.980
Or even if you're still weak to fire,

01:27:14.980 --> 01:27:18.110
you don't flinch and suffer through it.

01:27:19.370 --> 01:27:23.710
When my good friend
Pereroncino made you,

01:27:23.710 --> 01:27:25.970
he taught me a lot of good things.

01:27:26.610 --> 01:27:32.600
Ever since I came to this world, I've made
an effort to memorize all the NPC data.

01:27:32.600 --> 01:27:38.640
And even then, the one I know
best after Pandora's Actor is you...

01:27:38.640 --> 01:27:42.450
You said you didn't know my skills...

01:27:42.450 --> 01:27:44.650
That was obviously a lie.

01:27:44.650 --> 01:27:48.580
I just thought you'd act more
impulsively if you thought I didn't.

01:27:49.140 --> 01:27:51.090
If you had saved the
Impure Shockwave Shield,

01:27:51.090 --> 01:27:55.540
I think you would've been able to win.

01:28:01.760 --> 01:28:03.470
Perfect Warrior!

01:28:14.250 --> 01:28:18.890
I had planned to fight physically
from the beginning as well!

01:28:21.660 --> 01:28:22.700
No way!

01:28:22.700 --> 01:28:24.820
That's that person's armor!

01:28:25.390 --> 01:28:27.490
Touch Me-sama's, right?

01:28:27.490 --> 01:28:28.710
That's right.

01:28:28.710 --> 01:28:30.950
This is Touch Me-sama's armor.

01:28:31.590 --> 01:28:36.860
However, it's impossible to equip it
without being World Champion Class.

01:28:38.650 --> 01:28:40.130
Perfect Warrior.

01:28:41.570 --> 01:28:47.420
Using magic, you can equip
weapons without a class penalty.

01:28:47.420 --> 01:28:51.760
I never thought he'd be able to wear a
World Champion armor with Perfect Warrior.

01:28:52.550 --> 01:28:55.140
So he had planned so far ahead!

01:28:59.140 --> 01:29:00.690
That sword!

01:29:05.860 --> 01:29:10.490
Takemikazuchi Hachishiki?!

01:29:10.970 --> 01:29:14.410
That belongs to our Lord and
Warrior, Takemikazuchu-sama!

01:29:17.280 --> 01:29:19.220
I told you, Shalltear.

01:29:19.970 --> 01:29:23.630
\"Ainz Ooal Gown never loses.\"

01:29:24.710 --> 01:29:26.230
Know this.

01:29:26.230 --> 01:29:32.850
The one in front of you has gathered the power
of the 41 members of Ainz Ooal Gown!

01:29:32.850 --> 01:29:38.600
You had no chance to win from
the very beginning of this fight!

01:29:40.170 --> 01:29:42.870
Shalltear Bloodfallen.

01:29:42.870 --> 01:29:49.470
I'm the leader of the Supreme Beings
of the Great Tomb of Nazarick!

01:29:49.470 --> 01:29:54.830
I'll drill into you the power of the man
you all respect and call your master!

01:30:04.320 --> 01:30:05.960
An opening, huh?!

01:30:10.010 --> 01:30:12.720
Where do you see an
opening, Shalltear?!

01:30:12.720 --> 01:30:15.600
That's Nishikienrai-sama's...

01:30:16.790 --> 01:30:18.350
How did you...

01:30:24.280 --> 01:30:26.030
The holy element!

01:30:26.690 --> 01:30:28.240
Get away!

01:30:39.140 --> 01:30:42.330
How dare you make me
utter such a pathetic sound!

01:30:43.920 --> 01:30:44.790
That is...

01:30:45.460 --> 01:30:47.180
Houyi's Bow!

01:30:47.830 --> 01:30:50.420
Th-That's impossible...

01:30:50.420 --> 01:30:51.510
No way...

01:30:51.510 --> 01:30:53.990
That's Peroroncino-sama's weapon!

01:30:53.990 --> 01:30:57.600
How... no, where did you get it?!

01:30:57.930 --> 01:30:59.850
Allow me to tell you:

01:31:00.350 --> 01:31:02.230
I used a Cash Item.

01:31:02.230 --> 01:31:03.850
No way.

01:31:03.850 --> 01:31:05.110
The wooden sticks?

01:31:06.390 --> 01:31:07.990
I don't have any MP!

01:31:07.990 --> 01:31:09.940
And I can only block it with magic!

01:31:09.940 --> 01:31:12.210
Even a special skill would work...

01:31:12.210 --> 01:31:16.030
If only I had left some for now, then...

01:31:16.440 --> 01:31:17.910
No, that's wrong.

01:31:18.380 --> 01:31:20.690
Did you finally get it?

01:31:20.690 --> 01:31:23.790
Everything went just as I had planned.

01:31:30.250 --> 01:31:31.630
At this rate...

01:31:34.690 --> 01:31:36.920
That's some good resolve, Shalltear!

01:31:37.560 --> 01:31:40.810
This is where the climax begins!

01:31:41.930 --> 01:31:44.270
It's Ainz-sama's victory.

01:31:44.590 --> 01:31:45.750
How can you tell?

01:31:45.750 --> 01:31:50.280
In my opinion, victory
is still very far away.

01:31:50.280 --> 01:31:54.660
Shalltear stopped defending
and started attacking.

01:31:54.660 --> 01:31:57.050
If I were in her position,

01:31:57.050 --> 01:31:59.410
I would have no choice
but to do the same.

01:31:59.410 --> 01:32:03.330
Ainz-sama keeps changing
from weapon to weapon.

01:32:03.330 --> 01:32:06.740
So basically, since she doesn't
know what weapons he has,

01:32:06.740 --> 01:32:09.560
and she doesn't have
enough information,

01:32:09.560 --> 01:32:14.320
trying to break away
could also prove foolish.

01:32:14.320 --> 01:32:17.430
Especially after seeing
he has a bow and arrow.

01:32:17.810 --> 01:32:23.930
That's why Shalltear has no
choice but to fight up close.

01:32:24.280 --> 01:32:25.430
I see.

01:32:25.430 --> 01:32:27.590
I've come to understand now.

01:32:27.590 --> 01:32:30.310
So basically against Shalltear,
who has given up defending,

01:32:30.310 --> 01:32:32.230
Ainz-sama pulled out the axe and—

01:32:32.230 --> 01:32:35.530
The Blood Sucking Meat Devourer.

01:32:35.530 --> 01:32:37.190
Thank you, Cocytus.

01:32:37.190 --> 01:32:40.100
That Blood Sucking Meat
Devourer is, as you can see,

01:32:40.100 --> 01:32:43.290
unbalanced and hard to aim.

01:32:43.720 --> 01:32:47.420
But when he's up against a defenseless
Shalltear, it should be no problem.

01:32:47.420 --> 01:32:53.670
Everything in this battle has gone
according to Ainz-sama's plan.

01:32:54.000 --> 01:32:59.010
However, Shalltear can
recover using her Spuit Lance,

01:32:59.010 --> 01:33:02.730
but since Ainz-sama is a Warrior at
the moment, he can't use any magic.

01:33:02.730 --> 01:33:05.310
Doesn't that mean that
Ainz-sama is at a disadvantage?

01:33:05.310 --> 01:33:07.810
That's no problem at all.

01:33:08.330 --> 01:33:13.150
Now that he has presented
himself as Ainz Ooal Gown,

01:33:13.150 --> 01:33:16.400
he's going to win the battle.

01:33:21.910 --> 01:33:23.410
This feeling...

01:33:26.180 --> 01:33:27.740
Ainz-sama!

01:33:27.740 --> 01:33:31.630
Seems like you're going to
be the first to run out of HP!

01:33:32.100 --> 01:33:33.960
You really think so?

01:33:37.060 --> 01:33:38.850
Momonga!

01:33:38.850 --> 01:33:41.410
It's time already!

01:33:41.410 --> 01:33:43.930
Bukubukuchagama-sama?

01:33:44.370 --> 01:33:47.940
Hey, what time did you think that meant?

01:33:49.950 --> 01:33:54.590
Everything has been going
according to my plan so far,

01:33:54.590 --> 01:33:58.950
so what do you think this alarm is for?

01:34:02.970 --> 01:34:04.670
It's time to decide it.

01:34:04.670 --> 01:34:07.710
Time to decide the end of the battle.

01:34:07.710 --> 01:34:09.070
What are you talking about?

01:34:09.070 --> 01:34:11.710
My HP is still...

01:34:12.120 --> 01:34:17.510
A Super Tier Magic attack won't
take you down with your HP full.

01:34:17.510 --> 01:34:18.840
In that case,

01:34:18.840 --> 01:34:23.010
shouldn't I just lower it until I can
take you down with one blow?

01:34:31.240 --> 01:34:34.230
I might be weaker at
direct physical combat,

01:34:34.230 --> 01:34:36.480
but I'm superior in magic power.

01:34:36.480 --> 01:34:39.030
Alright then, prepare yourself, Shalltear!

01:34:41.910 --> 01:34:43.780
Super Tier Magic!

01:34:45.630 --> 01:34:52.040
Ainz-sama! Why are you using Supreme Tier
Magic that takes so long to cast right here?

01:34:54.980 --> 01:34:56.210
Don't tell me...

01:34:56.210 --> 01:34:58.710
Another Cash Item?!

01:35:07.400 --> 01:35:08.920
Fallen Down!

01:35:14.910 --> 01:35:18.820
Hail Ainz Ooal Gown-sama!

01:35:18.820 --> 01:35:24.320
He truly is the Supreme
Ruler of Nazarick...

01:35:27.070 --> 01:35:29.200
That brat...

01:35:36.390 --> 01:35:37.540
What an idiot.

01:35:37.540 --> 01:35:40.920
Even though she's an undead,
she got mind controlled.

01:35:41.340 --> 01:35:42.890
Onee-chan, what did you—

01:35:42.890 --> 01:35:44.810
Nothing.

01:35:44.810 --> 01:35:46.430
What about the battle—

01:35:46.750 --> 01:35:48.830
It was Ainz-sama's complete victory.

01:35:49.810 --> 01:35:52.670
We're retreating.

01:35:52.670 --> 01:35:53.790
Yeah!

01:35:59.070 --> 01:36:02.450
Alright, now I'll begin
Shalltear's resurrection.

01:36:03.110 --> 01:36:06.570
Albedo, look at Shalltear's
name in the list.

01:36:06.570 --> 01:36:11.580
If she's still under the effects of
mind control like before, then...

01:36:11.580 --> 01:36:17.590
Ainz-sama, if that happens, then
allow us to take care of her.

01:36:17.990 --> 01:36:19.460
Demiurge.

01:36:19.460 --> 01:36:26.090
There would be no more inappropriate
decision than letting you,

01:36:26.090 --> 01:36:28.970
Ainz-sama, face any further danger.

01:36:28.970 --> 01:36:30.850
No, but...

01:36:30.850 --> 01:36:33.780
If Shalltear still rebels against us,

01:36:33.780 --> 01:36:36.650
the guardians will deal with her.

01:36:36.650 --> 01:36:38.700
Please step back, master.

01:36:40.070 --> 01:36:41.220
Understood.

01:36:41.220 --> 01:36:45.240
Guardians, if that's the
case, I'll leave it to you.

01:36:48.040 --> 01:36:52.040
All you have to do is
stay here, Ainz-sama.

01:36:52.040 --> 01:36:55.180
If all the Supreme Beings are gone,

01:36:55.180 --> 01:36:59.250
who are we going to
dedicate our loyalty to?

01:36:59.250 --> 01:37:02.780
Also, even knowing you
didn't dispose of us,

01:37:02.780 --> 01:37:06.130
it would feel lonely
having no one around.

01:37:07.620 --> 01:37:09.140
That's right...

01:37:09.820 --> 01:37:12.510
It's lonely when everyone's gone...

01:37:14.070 --> 01:37:16.850
Guardians. Protect me!

01:37:16.850 --> 01:37:19.000
And now, let's get started.

01:37:19.000 --> 01:37:19.900
Yes!

01:37:20.760 --> 01:37:24.400
We need 500 million
gold to revive Shalltear.

01:37:25.160 --> 01:37:28.050
Shalltear, revive!

01:37:48.860 --> 01:37:49.910
Albedo!

01:37:52.010 --> 01:37:53.790
Rest at ease.

01:37:53.790 --> 01:37:56.270
The effects of mind control are gone.

01:37:56.270 --> 01:37:57.700
I see.

01:38:10.760 --> 01:38:12.160
Shalltear.

01:38:18.770 --> 01:38:20.420
Ainz-sama?

01:38:24.560 --> 01:38:26.310
I'm glad...

01:38:26.310 --> 01:38:27.920
No. I'm sorry.

01:38:28.560 --> 01:38:31.180
It was all my fault.

01:38:32.210 --> 01:38:33.270
No.

01:38:33.270 --> 01:38:35.810
I don't really understand what happened.

01:38:35.810 --> 01:38:39.190
But there's no way that
you made a mistake!

01:38:39.980 --> 01:38:42.310
So this is where my first time will—

01:38:42.310 --> 01:38:46.070
Ainz-sama. I believe
Shalltear must be tired.

01:38:47.180 --> 01:38:49.490
That's right!

01:38:51.800 --> 01:38:54.740
We'll discuss the details later.

01:38:55.200 --> 01:38:57.130
By the way, Ainz-sama.

01:38:57.130 --> 01:39:01.190
Why am I in the throne room?

01:39:01.190 --> 01:39:06.420
Also, why am I dressed like this
and being treated like this by you?

01:39:06.420 --> 01:39:11.130
Did I cause you any trouble?

01:39:11.610 --> 01:39:13.140
You don't remember?

01:39:14.120 --> 01:39:15.140
I don't...

01:39:15.640 --> 01:39:19.850
Which means that the identity of the person
who used the World Item on Shalltear

01:39:19.850 --> 01:39:21.640
will remain a mystery...

01:39:21.640 --> 01:39:23.770
Don't you feel unusual in any other way?

01:39:28.140 --> 01:39:30.530
No problems.

01:39:30.530 --> 01:39:32.150
I see.

01:39:32.150 --> 01:39:33.660
Ainz-sama!

01:39:36.720 --> 01:39:39.830
My chest... is gone!

01:39:41.960 --> 01:39:46.670
Do you realize the
situation you put us in?!

01:39:47.530 --> 01:39:51.880
You don't remember the worst
mistake a guardian could make?!

01:39:54.530 --> 01:39:58.980
Shalltear, you did something
unforgivable to Ainz-sama!

01:39:58.980 --> 01:40:00.610
You idiot!

01:40:00.610 --> 01:40:04.780
Do you understand at all
what role guardians serve?

01:40:04.780 --> 01:40:08.280
Do you know how much pain
Ainz-sama went through?

01:40:08.280 --> 01:40:10.740
I- I think so as well.

01:40:10.740 --> 01:40:15.150
You're always thinking
only about yourself...

01:40:47.230 --> 01:40:48.910
Ainz-sama...

01:40:52.800 --> 01:40:54.120
Albedo...

01:40:58.370 --> 01:41:02.370
Make sure to thoroughly
scold her as well...

01:41:02.370 --> 01:41:03.600
Absolutely!

01:41:03.600 --> 01:41:05.750
Make sure this idiot
doesn't hear the end of it!

01:41:06.170 --> 01:41:07.280
Indeed.

01:41:07.280 --> 01:41:10.420
I think some harsh
words would be better.

01:41:10.420 --> 01:41:14.510
Shalltear, you'll have to listen to
everything Ainz-sama has to say.

01:41:14.510 --> 01:41:19.010
But you don't have to
um... be so harsh on her...

01:41:27.410 --> 01:41:29.330
Let me tell you all right now.

01:41:29.330 --> 01:41:32.530
This time, it was my fault.

01:41:33.000 --> 01:41:35.160
I should be the one
getting scolded the most,

01:41:35.160 --> 01:41:37.780
even though we did manage
to gather a lot of information.

01:41:38.420 --> 01:41:41.630
Shalltear, you did nothing wrong.

01:41:41.630 --> 01:41:44.540
Don't forget that.

01:41:45.680 --> 01:41:47.540
Thank you very much.

01:41:48.010 --> 01:41:52.780
I'll leave explaining to Shalltear
everything that happened to Demiurge.

01:41:52.780 --> 01:41:53.380
Yes!

01:41:53.380 --> 01:41:57.380
By the way, why hasn't
Sebas returned to Nazarick?

01:41:57.380 --> 01:41:58.510
He's bait.

01:41:59.410 --> 01:42:02.980
We still don't know why
Shalltear was targeted.

01:42:02.980 --> 01:42:08.450
But it's probable that the next target
will be Sebas, who was with her.

01:42:08.450 --> 01:42:14.230
Albedo, gather a team that can scout
the surroundings near Sebas stealthily.

01:42:14.230 --> 01:42:15.030
Yes!

01:42:15.030 --> 01:42:19.030
Although I'm using Sebas as bait, I don't
intend to hand him over to the enemy.

01:42:19.030 --> 01:42:23.250
The moment the enemy gets
closer, we'll leap into action.

01:42:23.950 --> 01:42:27.660
I'll eventually meet the one who
used the World Item on Shalltear

01:42:27.660 --> 01:42:30.020
at some point in the future.

01:42:30.020 --> 01:42:32.690
And then, I'll make them pay!

01:42:33.780 --> 01:42:38.150
Also, I may have been too naive,

01:42:38.150 --> 01:42:45.240
but we've now confirmed that there's an
unknown foe that can bring harm to Nazarick.

01:42:45.240 --> 01:42:48.680
I want to strengthen
Nazarick immediately.

01:42:48.680 --> 01:42:50.490
In order to do that,

01:42:50.490 --> 01:42:55.600
I was thinking of using my ability
and creating an army of undead.

01:42:55.600 --> 01:42:58.010
About that, Ainz-sama.

01:42:58.570 --> 01:43:02.030
Your skill allows you to create undead,

01:43:02.030 --> 01:43:09.710
but human corpses can only
create undead level 40 or lower.

01:43:10.110 --> 01:43:11.710
That's true...

01:43:11.710 --> 01:43:16.430
It just so happens that Aura has
found a village of Lizard Men.

01:43:16.430 --> 01:43:20.290
Why don't you attack the
village and make use of them?

01:43:34.210 --> 01:43:38.420
The most powerful faction of the
Slane Theocracy's Black Scripture

01:43:38.420 --> 01:43:41.610
was destroyed by a single vampire...

01:43:42.220 --> 01:43:45.680
Kaire-sama used Downfall
of Castle and Country,

01:43:45.680 --> 01:43:48.620
but she was shot before the
mind control was complete.

01:43:48.620 --> 01:43:51.980
Two of us died in combat, and
one was seriously injured,

01:43:51.980 --> 01:43:54.540
so we decided to retreat.

01:43:55.140 --> 01:43:57.670
What should we do about this?

01:43:57.670 --> 01:44:02.560
The whereabouts of Nigun's
Sunlight Scripture are still unclear.

01:44:02.560 --> 01:44:05.690
The Windflower Scripture is still
chasing the traitor that took

01:44:05.690 --> 01:44:08.000
the Crown of Wisdom
from the Miko Princess.

01:44:08.000 --> 01:44:10.000
Considering we don't have much power,

01:44:10.000 --> 01:44:14.020
the only thing we can
do is monitor the area.

01:44:14.020 --> 01:44:17.860
Also, if there's anyone capable
of defeating that monster,

01:44:17.860 --> 01:44:20.440
we have to watch out for them as well.

01:44:21.410 --> 01:44:23.450
Understood.
